osters_empty":"No live boosters for this voucher","campaign_preset_label":"Start from a template","campaign_preset_classic":"Classic hackathon","campaign_preset_classic_desc":"Starter grant + percent deposit match","campaign_preset_match":"Deposit match only","campaign_preset_match_desc":"No starter — match qualifying top-ups","campaign_preset_starter":"Starter grant only","campaign_preset_starter_desc":"Credit on claim, no deposit match","campaign_preset_partner":"Partner-sponsored","campaign_preset_partner_desc":"Named partner, starter + match","campaign_advanced_title":"Advanced settings (scope, anti-abuse, join code)","campaign_preview_title":"Offer preview","campaign_preview_starter":"Claim code → {{amount}} starter","campaign_preview_match":"Top up {{topup}} → +{{match}} match ({{detail}})","campaign_preview_match_cap":"{{detail}}, cap {{cap}}","campaign_preview_match_fixed_detail":"flat {{amount}}","campaign_preview_window":"Match window {{start}} → {{end}}","campaign_preview_credit_expires":"Credit expires {{when}}","campaign_preview_budget_starters":"Budget {{budget}} funds ~{{claims}} starter grants","campaign_preview_budget":"Sponsor budget {{budget}}","campaign_edit_tag":"Edit","campaign_edit_title":"Edit draft campaign","campaign_submit_save":"Save changes","campaign_terms_updated":"Campaign updated","campaign_action_edit":"Edit","campaign_action_duplicate":"Duplicate","gated_empty_pool_warn":"Set both a weak and a strong pool (or use a quick-fill template) to tier by cost — while either is empty, that difficulty band (easy → weak, hard → strong) falls back to the full allowed-models set instead of staying tiered.","apps_visibility_saved":"Saved","apps_visibility_save_failed":"Save failed, please try again","apps_unavailable_title":"This app is unavailable","apps_unavailable_desc":"An administrator has turned off this app for your organization.","apps_visibility_title":"Apps visibility","apps_visibility_desc":"Control which apps users can see. Hidden apps are removed from the Apps hub and the sidebar.","fusion_flow_aria":"Your prompt fans out in parallel to {{panel}}, then {{judge}} judges the candidates and returns the single strongest answer.","fusion_flow_prompt":"Your prompt","fusion_flow_parallel":"In parallel","fusion_flow_best":"Best answer","fusion_taskaware_lead":"Only where it helps.","fusion_taskaware_note":"Fusion fans out to the panel on coding, agentic, tool-using and hard prompts — casual chat goes straight to a cheaper default, so you pay for the panel only on the requests where a second opinion pays off.","fusion_why_title":"Why a panel beats one model","fusion_why_body":"A single model gives you one attempt at your prompt — and no way to catch it when it is wrong. Fusion runs several frontier models on the same prompt at once, then an independent judge reads every answer and returns the strongest one, cross-checked against the others. Disagreement between strong models is signal: it surfaces the hard cases where one model alone would quietly get it wrong.","fusion_cmp_single":"Single model","fusion_cmp_single_d":"One model, one answer. No second opinion — if it is wrong, you ship it wrong.","fusion_cmp_router":"Auto-router","fusion_cmp_router_d":"Picks one model per prompt to save cost. Smarter selection — but still a single answer.","fusion_cmp_fusion":"Fusion","fusion_cmp_fusion_d":"A panel answers in parallel; a judge returns the strongest, cross-checked against the rest.","fusion_moa_panel":"Panel + judge (Mixture-of-Agents)","fusion_moa_single":"Single top model (GPT-4o)","fusion_moa_cap":"AlpacaEval 2.0 length-controlled win rate — a panel of models with an aggregator outscores a single top model.","fusion_moa_src":"Mixture-of-Agents, Wang et al. 2024","fusion_strat_bestof":"Best of N","fusion_strat_bestof_d":"A judge model ranks every candidate and serves the strongest one verbatim — never a diluted merge.","fusion_strat_majority":"Majority vote","fusion_strat_majority_d":"The panel votes on a structured answer — no extra judge call.","fusion_strat_synth":"Synthesize","fusion_strat_synth_d":"An aggregator model fuses the candidates into one improved answer (Mixture-of-Agents).","fusion_strat_tests":"Tests pass","fusion_strat_tests_d":"For code: the candidate whose patch actually passes your test harness wins.","fusion_strat_first":"First","fusion_strat_first_d":"A race — the lowest-latency leg wins, for when speed matters most.","fusion_why_nav":"Why a panel","fusion_dsl_nav":"Routing DSL","fusion_dsl_title":"Built on the routing DSL","fusion_dsl_body":"Fusion is not special-cased — it is a built-in config of our routing DSL, a small sandboxed language for defining exactly how each request is routed. Clone the \"Fable 5 Level\" template and change the panel, the judge, the gating rule, or the way the winner is chosen.","fusion_dsl_default":"Fusion default","fusion_trace_lead":"No black box.","fusion_trace_body":"Build your own router on the DSL and every fan-out is recorded — which models raced, each leg’s latency and status, and which answer the judge picked — so you can see in the console exactly why an answer won.","fusion_dsl_cta":"Open the routing DSL editor","fusion_faq_q3":"Does Fusion merge the answers together?","fusion_faq_a3":"No. The judge picks the single strongest candidate and returns it verbatim — you always get a real model’s answer, never an averaged or blended one.","fusion_faq_q4":"What happens if one of the models fails?","fusion_faq_a4":"The other legs still run and the judge picks from whatever succeeded; routing also fails over to the next-best deployment, so one provider hiccup does not fail the request.","fusion_faq_q5":"Does every request run the whole panel?","fusion_faq_a5":"No — only coding, agentic, tool-using and hard prompts fan out. Casual chat goes to a cheaper default, so you are billed for the panel only where a second opinion helps.","fusion_col_model":"Model","fusion_col_role":"Role","fusion_role_panel":"Panel","fusion_role_judge":"Judge","fusion_spec_tier":"Tier","fusion_spec_panel_value":"{{count}} models + judge","session_fingerprint_fallback":"Session fingerprint fallback","session_fingerprint_fallback_hint":"When clients send no session id (header or body field), identify the conversation by fingerprinting its head (system prompt + first user message) so cache-aware routing can still pin the session.","responses_claude_cache_inject":"Auto-inject Claude prompt cache (Responses)","responses_claude_cache_inject_hint":"For OpenAI-format clients (e.g. Codex) calling Claude models via /v1/responses, the server injects an ephemeral cache_control breakpoint on the stable system prefix so Anthropic prompt caching takes effect. Off by default.","responses_claude_cache_inject_1h":"Use 1-hour cache TTL (Responses)","responses_claude_cache_inject_1h_hint":"When the above injection is on, mark the breakpoint with a 1-hour TTL instead of the default 5 minutes — it survives gaps longer than 5 minutes between turns (common in long Codex sessions). Writes cost 2× vs 1.25×, so it pays off once the prefix is read 3+ times. On by default.","byok_back_to_providers":"All providers","byok_active_count":"{{active}} active","byok_provider_empty_keys":"No keys yet for this provider. Add one to route it through your own account.","byok_provider_custom":"Custom","byok_field_base_url":"Base URL","byok_mapping_platform_ph":"Platform model","byok_mapping_endpoint_ph":"Endpoint model","byok_mapping_add":"Add mapping","byok_mapping_hint":"Map a platform model (left — what bills) to the name your endpoint serves it under (right). Use “Fetch models” to list the endpoint’s models.","byok_err_mapping_incomplete":"Complete every mapping row — pick both a platform model and an endpoint model, with no duplicate platform models","byok_err_mapping_required":"Add at least one model mapping","byok_field_base_url_placeholder":"https://your-gateway.example.com","byok_field_base_url_hint":"OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Include the version segment (e.g. https://your-gateway.example.com/v1); /chat/completions and /models are appended automatically.","byok_field_served_models":"Served models","byok_field_served_models_hint":"Click \"Fetch models\" to list the models this endpoint serves, then pick which to enable.","byok_field_all_models_label":"All models — serve every platform model this endpoint supports","byok_field_model_mapping":"Model mapping","byok_field_model_mapping_hint":"JSON object mapping a platform model name to the name your endpoint expects. Leave empty to pass names through.","byok_fetch_models":"Fetch models","byok_fetch_models_loading":"Fetching…","byok_fetch_models_ok":"Found {{n}} models","byok_fetch_models_empty":"No platform-enabled models found at this endpoint.","byok_err_base_url_required":"Enter the base URL first","byok_err_served_required":"Select at least one model, or turn on All models","byok_err_model_mapping_invalid":"Model mapping must be a JSON object of \"model\": \"upstream\" pairs","byok_no_models":"No models selected","byok_search_providers":"Search providers…","byok_not_configured":"Not configured","byok_available_section":"Available","byok_test_pick_model":"Select model to test","byok_test_run":"Run Test","byok_test_auto_hint":"A servable model is picked automatically.","byok_disable_confirm_title":"Disable this key?","byok_disable_confirm_content":"Requests for this provider will use platform channels (full price) until re-enabled.","byok_enable_confirm_title":"Enable this key?","byok_enable_confirm_content":"This key will be tried first again for this provider.","byok_field_service_account":"Service Account JSON","byok_field_sa_rotate_placeholder":"Leave empty to keep the current credential","byok_field_sa_hint":"Paste your Google service account JSON. Stored encrypted — you won't see it again.","byok_field_region":"Region (optional)","byok_field_region_hint":"Defaults to 'global' if left empty.","byok_toggle_key_visibility":"Show / hide key","byok_models_all":"All","byok_models_specific":"Specific","byok_models_all_hint":"Every model this provider serves on the platform.","byok_field_models_select_placeholder":"Select models — leave empty for all","byok_opt_model_source_label":"Model source channels","request_tokens_io":"Tokens (in/out)","request_key_source":"Key / Source","byok_opt_model_source_help":"Required. Comma-separated OFFICIAL channel ids. The BYOK provider list and the custom/official model lists are built ONLY from these channels (so reverse-engineered channels never pollute the catalog). Empty = no BYOK models offered.","model_delisted_badge":"SEO","model_archive_title":"SEO Keep-Alive","model_archive_help":"Models removed from all channels but kept on the public SEO surfaces (/models, detail pages, sitemap) to preserve search ranking. They stay out of the API model list and routing.","model_archive_input_placeholder":"Enter a model name, e.g. openai/gpt-4o","model_archive_added":"Added to the SEO keep-alive list","model_archive_removed":"Removed from the SEO keep-alive list","model_archive_remove_confirm":"Remove this model from the SEO keep-alive list?","model_archive_load_failed":"Failed to load","model_archive_save_failed":"Failed to save","model_archive_delete_failed":"Failed to delete","model_archive_col_model":"Model","model_archive_delete":"Delete","model_archive_add":"Add","zdr_admin_grant_btn":"Grant ZDR","zdr_admin_revoke_btn":"Revoke ZDR","zdr_admin_revoke_confirm":"Revoke Zero Data Retention for this workspace? Future traffic returns to normal logging and routing, and the DPA-bound guarantee no longer applies.","zdr_admin_contract_label":"DPA / contract reference","zdr_admin_erase_confirm_btn":"Confirm: erase all data","zdr_admin_granted":"ZDR granted.","zdr_admin_revoked":"ZDR revoked.","channel_zdr_eligible_label":"ZDR eligible","channel_zdr_eligible_help":"Route Zero Data Retention workspaces to this channel — enable only for endpoints under a zero-retention / no-training agreement.","zdr_panel_title":"Zero Data Retention","zdr_badge_active":"Active","zdr_active_desc":"Prompts and responses are never stored, and traffic is routed only to zero-retention providers.","zdr_enforce_no_content":"Prompts & responses are never stored","zdr_enforce_no_ip":"Client IP is never recorded","zdr_enforce_routing":"Routed only to ZDR-eligible providers (store:false upstream)","zdr_eligible_hint":"Available on your plan — contact your platform admin to enable it (a signed DPA is required).","zdr_upsell":"Zero Data Retention is available on the Enterprise plan.","zdr_erase_btn":"Request data erasure","zdr_erase_confirm":"Permanently delete all stored logs and request/response data for this workspace? This cannot be undone.","zdr_erase_done":"Data erased.","zdr_erase_failed":"Erasure failed.","zdr_erase_partial":"Partial erasure — these stores failed and need a retry: {{stores}}","zdr_erase_ch_manual":"ClickHouse analytics mirror is not auto-purged — run the documented operator purge (ALTER TABLE ... DELETE WHERE workspace_id = {{id}}) to complete erasure.","zdr_erase_ch_pending":"Primary data erased. The analytics-store copy will be purged by an operator to complete the request.","pwa_install_title":"Install OrcaRouter","pwa_install_ios_title":"Add to Home Screen","pwa_install_body":"Add OrcaRouter to your home screen for one-tap access.","pwa_install_ios_hint":"Tap the Share icon, then “Add to Home Screen”.","pwa_install_cta":"Install","pwa_install_dismiss":"Not now","pwa_install_ios_step1":"Tap the Share icon in Safari’s toolbar.","pwa_install_ios_step2":"Choose “Add to Home Screen” from the menu.","pwa_install_ios_step3":"Tap “Add” to finish.","pwa_install_ios_guide_done":"Got it","pwa_install_ios_guide_close":"Close guide","byok_nav":"BYOK","byok_breadcrumb":"Breadcrumb","sidebar_badge_new":"New","byok_page_chip":"Provider keys","byok_page_subtitle":"Bring your own provider API keys to use your existing rate limits and provider credits — you pay the provider directly.","byok_add_key_btn":"Add provider key","byok_fee_banner":"Requests served through your keys are billed a {{fee}}% platform fee instead of the full token price. If a key fails, requests fall back to platform channels at full price (flagged in logs) unless 'Always use' is set.","byok_keys_count":"{{n}} keys","byok_prioritized_section":"Prioritized — tried before platform channels","byok_all_models":"All models","byok_status_active":"Active","byok_status_disabled":"Disabled","byok_status_auto_disabled":"Auto-disabled","byok_always_use_label":"Always use","byok_always_use_aria":"Always use {{name}}","byok_always_use_tooltip":"Never fall back to platform channels (full price) for this provider — the upstream error is surfaced instead.","byok_action_test":"Test","byok_action_testing":"Testing…","byok_action_disable":"Disable","byok_action_enable":"Enable","byok_delete_confirm_title":"Delete this key?","byok_delete_confirm_content":"The encrypted key material is wiped immediately. Requests for this provider will use platform channels.","byok_test_success":"Key verified — {{ms}} ms","byok_enabled_toast":"Key enabled","byok_disabled_toast":"Key disabled","byok_deleted_toast":"Key deleted","byok_saved_toast":"Key saved","byok_updated_toast":"Key updated","byok_unnamed_key":"Untitled key","byok_modal_add_title":"Add provider key","byok_modal_edit_title":"Edit provider key","byok_field_provider":"Provider","byok_field_name":"Display name","byok_field_name_placeholder":"e.g. Production OpenAI","byok_field_key":"API key","byok_field_key_placeholder":"sk-...","byok_field_key_rotate_placeholder":"Leave empty to keep the current key","byok_field_key_hint":"Stored encrypted — you won't see it again, only a masked label.","byok_field_models":"Allowed models","byok_field_models_placeholder":"e.g. gpt-4o, o3","byok_field_models_hint":"Comma-separated list. Empty = all models for this provider.","byok_field_always_use":"Always use this key — never fall back to platform channels (full price) for this provider","byok_security_note":"Keys are encrypted at rest and only decrypted in memory at request time. After saving, only a masked label is shown. Workspace admins can add, rotate, disable, or delete keys.","byok_no_providers":"No eligible providers are available right now — the platform has not enabled any channels for BYOK yet.","byok_save_btn":"Save key","byok_saving_btn":"Saving…","byok_err_provider_required":"Select a provider","byok_err_key_required":"Enter the API key","byok_empty_title":"Bring your own provider keys","byok_empty_desc":"Use your existing rate limits and provider credits. You pay the provider directly; OrcaRouter bills only a {{fee}}% platform fee.","byok_disabled_platform":"BYOK is not enabled on this platform.","byok_disabled_manage_banner":"BYOK is not enabled for this workspace, so requests are no longer served through these keys. You can still disable, rotate, or delete the stored keys below.","byok_members_placeholder":"Workspace admins manage provider keys. Ask a workspace admin or owner if you need a key added.","byok_role_error_desc":"Could not verify your workspace role. Check your connection and try again.","byok_role_error_retry":"Retry","byok_settings_tab":"BYOK","marker_surface_tab":"Marker Surface","marker_surface_refresh_failed":"Refresh failed, please retry","marker_surface_no_changes":"No changes to save","marker_surface_partial_failed":"Some settings failed to save, please retry","marker_surface_saved":"Settings saved","marker_surface_save_failed":"Save failed, please retry","marker_surface_section":"Marker surface (white-label)","marker_surface_intro":"When an inbound request carries the trigger header (and matching secret, if set) OR arrives on a configured trigger host, the response has the configured headers stripped and GET /v1/models returns only the alias whitelist. Leave both the trigger header and trigger hosts empty to disable the feature entirely — normal traffic is never affected.","marker_surface_trigger_header_label":"Trigger header","marker_surface_trigger_hosts_label":"Trigger hosts","marker_surface_trigger_hosts_help":"Comma-separated inbound Host names that activate the white-label surface on their own — no trigger header needed. Use this when a dedicated domain is mapped straight to OrcaRouter. A request triggers if the trigger header matches OR its Host is listed here. Trusts the inbound Host, so only expose this app behind a front door that enforces host routing.","marker_surface_trigger_header_help":"Inbound request header that activates the white-label surface. Empty = header trigger off (trigger hosts, if set, still apply).","marker_surface_trigger_value_label":"Shared secret","marker_surface_trigger_value_placeholder":"optional","marker_surface_trigger_value_help":"Write-only: a saved secret is never shown here. Leave blank to keep it; type a new value to replace it. If set, the trigger header value must equal this secret; empty = the header presence alone triggers.","marker_surface_clear_secret_label":"Clear saved secret","marker_surface_clear_secret_help":"Turn on and save to remove a previously saved secret and revert to presence-only mode.","marker_surface_model_whitelist_label":"Model whitelist","marker_surface_model_whitelist_help":"Comma-separated alias model ids exposed on the marker /v1/models. These are hidden from every normal catalog surface. They must be made routable separately via channel model_mapping + group abilities.","marker_surface_strip_headers_label":"Strip headers","marker_surface_strip_headers_help":"Comma-separated exact response header names to strip on a matched request (case-insensitive). Leave the built-in default unless you need more.","marker_surface_strip_prefixes_label":"Strip header prefixes","marker_surface_strip_prefixes_help":"Comma-separated response header name prefixes to strip (e.g. X-Orca- removes OrcaRouter identity headers).","marker_surface_save":"Save marker surface settings","byok_settings_section":"Global BYOK settings","byok_settings_intro":"BYOK keys serve the provider's default endpoint (or a Custom endpoint you configure) directly — no per-channel setup needed. Requests prefer the workspace key and fall back to platform channels at full price.","byok_opt_enabled_label":"Enable BYOK","byok_opt_enabled_help":"Master switch. When off, the user console page shows a disabled state and no key substitution happens.","byok_opt_fallback_label":"Fall back to platform channels on key failure","byok_opt_fallback_help":"When a workspace key fails, retry on platform channels at FULL price (flagged in logs). When off, the upstream error is surfaced. Per-key 'Always use' always fails fast.","byok_opt_fee_label":"Platform fee","byok_opt_fee_suffix":"% of normal price","byok_opt_fee_help":"Charged on BYOK requests as a share of what the workspace would normally have paid. Stored as the byok_setting.fee_ratio option (5% = 0.05).","byok_opt_free_label":"Free requests per month","byok_opt_free_help":"Monthly per-workspace allowance with no fee. 0 = disabled.","byok_opt_providers_label":"Allowed providers","byok_opt_providers_help":"Comma-separated channel type ids users may add keys for. Empty = every eligible type.","byok_opt_beta_label":"Beta workspace allowlist","byok_opt_beta_help":"Comma-separated workspace ids. Empty = all workspaces.","byok_settings_save":"Save BYOK settings","byok_settings_no_changes":"No changes to save","byok_settings_saved":"Settings saved","byok_settings_save_failed":"Save failed, please retry","byok_settings_partial_failed":"Some settings failed to save, please retry","byok_settings_refresh_failed":"Refresh failed, please retry","billing_filter_label":"Billing","billing_filter_all":"All billing","billing_filter_platform":"Platform","billing_filter_byok":"BYOK","billing_filter_byok_fallback":"BYOK fallback","billing_pill_byok":"BYOK","billing_pill_byok_fallback":"FALLBACK","byok_admin_export_csv":"Export CSV","byok_admin_