xpansion during a renewal push). Matches the workspace health bucket or the billing group. Stacks on top of global + amount tiers.","pkce_scope_label":"Scope"," + Web搜索 {{count}}次 / 1K 次 * {{symbol}}{{price}} * {{ratioType}} {{ratio}}_other":" + Web search {{count}} times / 1K times * {{symbol}}{{price}} * {{ratioType}} {{ratio}}","keys_created_close_aria":"Close","基于当前消费速率":"based on run rate","browse_all_models":"Browse all models","Unified LLM gateway with zero markup":"Unified LLM gateway with zero markup","已过期":"Expired","置信度":"Confidence","分组是用于控制计费倍率和模型访问权限的核心概念。每个用户属于一个分组，每个令牌也可以指定使用某个分组。":"Groups are a core concept for controlling billing ratios and model access. Each user belongs to a group, and each token can be assigned to a specific group.","billing.add_credits_title":"Add credits","partner.view.integration.tab_badge":"Badge","第三方账户绑定状态（只读）":"Third-party account binding status (read-only)","已设置":"Configured","Disabled":"Disabled","admin.partners.detail_min_payout":"Min payout","签到奖励的最小额度":"Minimum quota for check-in rewards","prompt_form_tag_remove":"Remove tag","已打开授权页面":"Authorization page opened","prompt_new_btn":"New prompt","共 {{count}} 个密钥_other":"{{count}} keys","routing_adoption_strategy_col_p50":"p50 (ms)","observability_status_disabled":"No","分组速率配置优先级高于全局速率限制。":"Group rate configuration priority is higher than global rate limit.","API 配置":"API Configuration","via default":"via default","points.earn_tokens_10m_progress":"{{current}} / {{total}} tokens","GC 执行失败":"GC execution failed","points.time_hours_ago":"{{n}}h ago","规则描述（可选）":"Rule description (optional)","删除条件":"Delete Condition","响应缺少凭据":"Response missing credentials","request_logs.usage_completion":"Completion tokens","没有可用令牌用于填充":"No available tokens for filling","plan_hacker":"Hacker","成功后切换亲和":"Switch Affinity on Success","tie":"Tie","创建令牌默认选择auto分组，初始令牌也将设为auto（否则留空，为用户默认分组）":"Create token with auto group by default, initial token will also be set to auto (otherwise leave blank for user default group)","points.streak_days_other":"{{count}} days","可视化倍率设置":"Visual model ratio settings","排序":"Sort Order","partner.bank.empty_explanation":"We pay out via bank transfer. Your bank details are encrypted at rest and only revealed to admins for offline wiring.","prompt_history_diff_label":"Diff vs active","可用分组":"Available groups","例如：清理工具参数，避免上游校验错误":"e.g. clean tool params to avoid upstream validation errors","op1_desc":"Every prompt is graded, then sent straight to the chosen model's first-party provider — no reseller in the middle. The grade, model, and provider are shown on each request, so a route is never a black box.","ttfc_popover_title":"Get to your first API call","思考过程":"Thinking process","billing.low_balance_banner_body":"Your wallet is {{balance}}. Requests will fail when balance reaches 0.","兑换码创建成功":"Redemption Code Created","划转额度":"Transfer amount","确认延长":"Confirm Extension","请输入兑换码":"Please enter the redemption code","保存聊天设置":"Save chat settings","common.loading":"Loading…","确认取消密码登录":"Confirm cancel password login","渠道管理":"Upstreams","marketing_sending":"Sending…","用户优先：如果用户在请求中指定了系统提示词，将优先使用用户的设置":"User priority: If the user specifies a system prompt in the request, the user's setting will be used first","从 0.5 降到 0.3":"reduced from 0.5 to 0.3","plan_e2":"✓ Private / on-prem deployment","prompt_action_edit":"Edit","prompt_help_models_body":"Prompts are model-agnostic. The same prompt rides over GPT-5, Claude, Gemini — picking the upstream model is the job of Routing and the API key’s group; Prompts never overrides that selection.","prompt_playground_subtitle":"Dispatch this prompt against a real model. Counted against your workspace wallet at the live rate.","实际花费":"You paid","移除":"Remove","observability_env_only_note":"These settings are configured via environment variables at startup and cannot be edited here.","prompt_col_labels":"Version labels","points.streak_days_one":"{{count}} day","enterprise.reqlog_save":"Save request-log settings","配置 WeChat Server":"Configure WeChat Server","渠道标签":"Upstream Tag","admin_points_reason_required":"Reason is required for audit.","insights_tab_replay":"Replay","insights_budget_quality_skip":"skip","IP白名单":"IP Whitelist","acquisition_funnel_empty":"No signups in the selected range","分组名称到倍率的映射":"Mapping of group names to ratios","routing_adoption_strategy_col_p95":"p95 (ms)","更新套餐信息":"Update Plan Info","routing_adoption_trend_metric_calls":"Calls","integrations_n8n_low_balance_placeholder":"Empty disables low-balance webhook delivery (email still fires)","integrations_n8n_user_signup_label":"New user signup n8n webhook URL","integrations_n8n_user_signup_placeholder":"Empty disables new-user signup notifications","integrations_n8n_user_payment_label":"Payment n8n webhook URL","integrations_n8n_user_payment_placeholder":"Empty disables payment notifications","integrations_n8n_waitlist_label":"Voucher waitlist n8n webhook URL","integrations_n8n_waitlist_placeholder":"Empty disables waitlist signup notifications","integrations_backfill_section":"Historical sync","integrations_backfill_description":"Replay existing users and paying customers into the n8n webhooks. One-shot ops tooling — real-time events flow automatically.","integrations_backfill_users_total":"Users","integrations_backfill_signup_delivered":"Signup sends (incl. replays)","integrations_backfill_payment_delivered":"Payments delivered","integrations_backfill_payment_pending":"Payments pending","integrations_backfill_payment_stale":"Stale in-flight","integrations_backfill_signup_done_rescan":"Window complete — for certainty, reset the cursor and re-scan from the start (replay-safe)","integrations_backfill_waitlist_done_rescan":"Window complete — for certainty, reset the cursor and re-scan from the start (replay-safe)","integrations_backfill_payment_stale_warning":"Queue drained, but {{n}} stale in-flight rows need manual review via n8n logs","integrations_backfill_payment_running_warning":"{{n}} deliveries still running — refresh shortly to confirm completion","integrations_backfill_status_unconfirmed":"Status check failed — refresh to confirm completion before stopping","integrations_backfill_payment_blocked":"Migration incomplete — restart to retry before syncing","integrations_backfill_reset_cursor_btn":"Reset cursor","integrations_backfill_reset_waitlist_cursor_btn":"Reset waitlist cursor","integrations_backfill_payment_in_flight":"Delivering now","integrations_backfill_signup_btn":"Sync historical signups","integrations_backfill_signup_next_btn":"Continue signups (after #{{id}})","integrations_backfill_waitlist_btn":"Sync historical waitlist","integrations_backfill_waitlist_next_btn":"Continue waitlist (after #{{id}})","integrations_backfill_payment_btn":"Sync historical payments","integrations_backfill_refresh_btn":"Refresh","integrations_backfill_batch_queued":"Queued {{n}} items — check status shortly","integrations_backfill_signup_done":"Signup sync complete","integrations_backfill_payment_done":"Payment sync complete","integrations_backfill_hint":"Run payment sync repeatedly until pending reaches 0. Stale in-flight rows need manual review via n8n logs.","partner.apply.failed":"Application failed. Please try again.","免责声明：仅限个人使用，请勿分发或共享任何凭证。该渠道存在前置条件与使用门槛，请在充分了解流程与风险后使用，并遵守 OpenAI 的相关条款与政策。相关凭证与配置仅限接入 Codex CLI 使用，不适用于其他客户端、平台或渠道。":"Disclaimer: Personal use only. Do not distribute or share any credentials. This upstream has prerequisites and requires prior setup; use only if you understand the flow and risks, and comply with OpenAI’s terms and policies. Credentials and configuration are for Codex CLI integration only, and are not intended for any other client, platform, or upstream.","admin.settings.defaults_saved":"Defaults saved.","文字提示 {{nonCacheInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}} + 缓存 {{cacheInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{cachePrice}} + 文字补全 {{completion}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{compPrice}} = {{symbol}}{{total}}":"Text prompt {{nonCacheInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}} + Cache {{cacheInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{cachePrice}} + Text completion {{completion}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{compPrice}} = {{symbol}}{{total}}","参数覆盖必须是合法的 JSON 对象":"Parameter override must be a valid JSON object","billing.plan_unit_year":"year","此项只读，需要用户通过个人设置页面的相关绑定按钮进行绑定，不可直接修改":"Read-only, user's personal settings, and cannot be modified directly","routing_adoption_strategy_col_strategy":"Strategy","executive_kpi_subscription_cash":"Subscription cash","perm_promote_labels_label":"Promote prompt labels","WeChat Server 访问凭证":"WeChat Server Access Credential","admin.partners.edit_help_holdback_days":"Days earnings are held before becoming eligible for payout (covers refunds, disputes).","最后请求":"Last request","partner.view.payment_method.verified_at":"Verified at","acquisition_trend_empty":"No signups in the selected range","忘记密码？":"Forgot password?","Key 摘要":"Key summary","Midjourney 任务记录":"Midjourney Task Records","计费类型":"Billing type","request_logs.error_status":"Status code","Back to sign in":"Back to sign in","rewards_early_desc":"Revenue share is proportional to your Points balance relative to all other Storm-tier members. Right now, the pool is small and the denominator is tiny. Developers who reach Storm tier during the early period will hold an outsized share of the pool as the platform scales. This advantage compounds — your share only dilutes as new members reach Storm, which takes months of sustained usage.","request_logs.open_settings_link":"Open logging settings","编辑元数据":"Edit metadata","(输入 {{nonAudioInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}} + 音频输入 {{audioInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{audioPrice}}":"(Input {{nonAudioInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}} + Audio input {{audioInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{audioPrice}}","移除 functionResponse.id 字段":"Remove functionResponse.id Field","不能填 orcarouter/ 前缀的模型（会造成循环）":"orcarouter/-prefixed models are not allowed (would create a loop)","Create API key":"Create API key","计算费用中...":"Calculating fees...","billing.recommended_badge":"Recommended","partner.apply.field_description":"Tell us about yourself","已复制版本号":"Version copied","将把当前编辑中的模型 {{name}} 的价格配置，批量应用到已勾选的 {{count}} 个模型。_other":"Will apply the pricing config of the currently edited model {{name}} to the {{count}} selected models in bulk.","prompt_help_webhooks_body":"Outbound HTTP endpoints that fire signed JSON events whenever a prompt is created, updated, deleted, or has a label promoted. Use them to sync prompts to your secret manager, trigger CI, or notify on-call. Owner-only config.","prompt_purge_confirm":"","批量删除":"Batch Delete","models_page_subtitle":"Browse 200+ AI models accessible through one OrcaRouter API key. Compare context windows, pricing and modalities for OpenAI GPT-5, Anthropic Claude Opus, Google Gemini, Llama, Mistral, DeepSeek, Qwen and more.","过期于":"Expires at","缓存条目数":"Cache Entries","how_step1_title":"Point your SDK at us","routing_howitworks_tab_why":"4. Why","flagship_count":"Flagship {{n}}","billing.tier_team_benefit_2":"600 requests per minute (10× Hacker)","已成功开始测试所有已启用通道，请刷新页面查看结果。":"Successfully started testing all enabled channels. Please refresh page to view results.","billing.current_plan_btn":"Current plan","prompt_page_subtitle":"Workspace-scoped system prompts injected via token binding. Promote a label to roll out without redeploying.","marketing_plans_edit_link":"To create or edit plans, use the Subscriptions admin page.","billing.plan_enterprise_feat_3":"✓ 99.99% uptime SLA","executive_daily_col_token_spend":"Token spend","executive_daily_col_byok_requests":"BYOK reqs","executive_daily_col_byok_tokens":"BYOK tokens","executive_daily_col_byok_fee":"BYOK fee","API令牌管理":"API token management","members_token_disable":"Disable tokens","编辑成功":"Edit Successful","上传图片":"Upload image","sidebar_revenue":"Revenue","sidebar_finance":"Finance","finance_report_title":"Finance Report","finance_report_subtitle":"Period-over-period money movement across the platform.","finance_tab_spend_margin":"Spend & Margin","finance_tab_loss_leaders":"Loss Leaders","finance_loss_leaders_dimension":"Group by","finance_loss_leaders_dim_workspace":"Workspace","finance_loss_leaders_dim_model":"Model","finance_loss_leaders_dim_channel":"Channel","finance_loss_leaders_lens":"Lens","finance_loss_leaders_lens_paid":"Paid margin","finance_loss_leaders_lens_gross":"Gross margin","finance_loss_leaders_kpi_negative_segments":"Negative segments","finance_loss_leaders_kpi_revenue_at_risk":"Revenue at risk","finance_loss_leaders_kpi_worst_offender":"Worst offender","finance_loss_leaders_kpi_coverage":"Cost coverage","finance_loss_leaders_col_segment":"Segment","finance_loss_leaders_col_requests":"Requests","finance_loss_leaders_col_revenue":"Revenue","finance_loss_leaders_col_cost":"Cost","finance_loss_leaders_col_paid_gp":"Paid GP","finance_loss_leaders_col_gross_gp":"Gross GP","finance_loss_leaders_col_margin_pct":"Margin %","finance_tab_cash_inflow":"Cash Inflow","finance_tab_subscriptions":"Subscriptions / MRR","finance_tab_promo_credits":"Promo Credits","finance_tab_wallet_liability":"Wallet Liability","finance_tab_vendor_spend":"Vendor Spend","finance_tab_tax":"Tax","finance_tab_currency":"Currency","finance_tab_reconciliation":"Reconciliation","finance_tab_placeholder":"This tab is scheduled for a follow-up PR.","finance_granularity_day":"Day","finance_granularity_week":"Week","finance_granularity_month":"Month","finance_granularity_quarter":"Quarter","finance_banner_granularity_forced":"This tab requires monthly or quarterly granularity. Showing monthly.","finance_col_period":"Period (UTC)","finance_col_consumption":"Consumption","finance_col_promo_revenue":"Promo","finance_col_paid_revenue":"Paid","finance_col_list_price":"List price","finance_col_cost":"Cost","finance_col_gross_margin":"Gross margin","finance_col_gross_margin_pct":"Margin %","finance_col_gross_charged":"Gross charged","finance_col_psp_fee":"PSP fee","finance_col_net_settled":"Net settled","finance_col_refunds":"Refunds","finance_col_net_cash":"Net cash","finance_col_mrr_snapshot":"MRR (end of period)","finance_col_new_mrr":"New MRR","finance_col_expansion_mrr":"Expansion","finance_col_contraction_mrr":"Contraction","finance_col_churned_mrr":"Churned","finance_col_net_new_mrr":"Net new","finance_col_opening_balance":"Opening balance","finance_col_closing_balance":"Closing balance","finance_col_topups":"Top-ups","finance_col_grants":"Grants","finance_col_adjustments":"Adjustments","finance_col_net_change":"Net change","finance_drift_warning_banner":"Wallet liability walk-back disagrees with the live SUM(wallet_quota) by {{pct}}. Investigate before signing off on this period.","finance_anchor_label":"Current SUM(wallet_quota): {{usd}}","finance_col_jurisdictions":"Jurisdictions","finance_col_tax_collected":"Tax collected","finance_col_taxable_revenue":"Taxable rev","finance_col_tax_exempt_revenue":"Exempt rev","finance_col_gross_revenue":"Gross rev","finance_banner_tax_granularity":"Daily / weekly granularity disabled on Tax tab. Showing monthly.","finance_export_csv":"Export CSV","finance_empty_no_data":"No data for the selected range.","finance_promo_source_signup":"Signup","finance_promo_source_partner_payout_wallet_credit":"Partner payout","finance_promo_source_admin_manual":"Admin manual","finance_promo_source_redemption_code":"Redemption code","finance_promo_source_promo_bucket":"Scoped voucher credit","finance_promo_source_other":"Other","redemption_status_exhausted":"Exhausted","redemption_col_code":"Code","redemption_code_masked_hint":"Hidden — use View or Copy","redemption_col_usage":"Usage","redemption_action_uses":"Uses","redemption_usage_aria":"redemption usage","redemption_type_label":"Type","redemption_type_multi":"One code, many claims","redemption_type_multi_desc":"Share a single code with a community. Tracks claims per account.","redemption_type_batch":"Batch of single-use codes","redemption_type_batch_desc":"N distinct codes, one claim each — grouped.","redemption_custom_key_label":"Code","redemption_custom_key_placeholder":"Leave empty for a random code","redemption_custom_key_hint":"Letters, digits, dash - 8 to 64 chars - leave empty for a random code","redemption_custom_key_invalid":"Code must be 8-64 letters, digits or dashes","redemption_custom_key_immutable_hint":"The code cannot be changed after creation","redemption_max_uses_label":"Max claims","redemption_max_uses_batch_hint":"Each code in a batch is single-use","redemption_max_uses_min_used":"Max claims cannot be lower than claims already used ({{count}})","redemption_max_uses_invalid":"Max uses must be between 1 and 10000","redemption_per_user_label":"Per account","redemption_per_user_fixed_hint":"Fixed at 1 in v1","redemption_targeting_title":"Targeting","redemption_targeting_desc":"Optionally restrict which models the credit applies to and which countries can claim this voucher. Leave both empty for a normal, unrestricted voucher.","redemption_model_scope_label":"Model targeting","redemption_model_scope_placeholder":"Pick models — or type a pattern like gpt-4o* — leave empty for all models","redemption_model_scope_hint":"A hard restriction, not a preference: the credit can ONLY pay for these models — a call to any other model is billed to the wallet instead. Wildcards cover a whole family (gpt-4o* also covers gpt-4o-mini, gpt-4o-realtime-preview, …), while an exact name matches only itself (gpt-4o does not cover gpt-4o-mini). Requires promo credit to be enabled (Settings → Operation).","redemption_unscoped_promo_warning":"No model targeting + a credit expiry: this voucher grants expiring promo credit scoped to ALL MODELS, not wallet credit. It is spendable on every model, and cannot be spent on async task routes at all. Set model targeting to restrict it, or clear the expiry (here and in Settings → Operation) to grant wallet credit instead.","redemption_model_scope_use_pattern":"Use pattern \"{{pattern}}\"","redemption_country_scope_label":"Country targeting","redemption_country_scope_placeholder":"Any country (leave empty)","redemption_country_scope_hint":"Restrict who can claim this voucher by country. Leave empty to allow all regions. Requires server-side geolocation (MaxMind); a visitor whose country can't be determined is blocked.","redemption_require_card_label":"Require a card on file to claim","redemption_require_card_hint":"Anti-abuse for paid campaigns: the claimer must add a payment card (US$0 charged) before the credit is granted. Best for high-value, ad-driven drops.","redemption_credit_expires_label":"Credit expiry (days)","redemption_credit_expires_placeholder":"0 = use default","redemption_credit_expires_hint":"Days after a claim before the granted credit expires. 0 (or empty) uses the workspace default (Settings → Operation). Expiring unscoped credit needs promo credit enabled.","promo_credit_section":"Model-scoped promo credit","promo_credit_enable_label":"Enable model-scoped promo credit","promo_credit_save":"Save","promo_credit_no_changes":"No changes to save","promo_credit_save_success":"Saved","promo_credit_save_failed":"Save failed, please retry","promo_credit_desc":"Enable model-targeted voucher credit. When on, a voucher can restrict its credit to specific models: that credit can ONLY pay for those models, and calls to anything else are billed to the wallet. This must be on for the \"Model targeting\" field in the voucher editor to work — otherwise a model-scoped voucher is rejected. Note the side effect of the default expiry below: an UNSCOPED voucher with any expiry also stops granting wallet credit and grants promo credit valid on all models instead.","promo_credit_default_expires_label":"Default credit expiry (days)","promo_credit_default_expires_hint":"Voucher credit that does not set its own expiry expires this many days after it is claimed. 0 = no default (credit never expires unless the voucher sets one). Only effective while promo credit is enabled above — expiring credit lives in the promo-credit ledger.","redemption_batch_count_label":"Number of codes","redemption_batch_count_min":"At least 1 code per batch","redemption_batch_count_max":"At most 100 codes per batch","redemption_uses_title":"Voucher uses","redemption_uses_claimed":"{{used}} / {{max}} claimed","redemption_uses_col_user":"User","redemption_uses_col_workspace":"Workspace","redemption_uses_col_granted":"Granted","redemption_uses_col_time":"Claimed at","redemption_uses_empty":"No claims yet","redemption_view_toggle_aria":"voucher view","redemption_view_codes":"Codes","redemption_view_batches":"Batches","redemption_view_waitlist":"Waitlist","redemption_action_view":"View","redemption_action_copy":"Copy","redemption_manage_campaign":"Manage campaign →","campaign_action_delete":"Delete","campaign_action_delete_confirm_title":"Delete campaign?","campaign_action_delete_confirm_content":"This removes the campaign and disables its join code permanently. Enrollment and match history will no longer be visible in the console. This cannot be undone.","campaign_action_delete_confirm_ok":"Delete campaign","campaign_deleted":"Campaign deleted","campaign_tab_overview":"Overview","campaign_tab_participants":"Participants","campaign_participants_col_workspace":"Workspace","campaign_participants_col_user":"User","campaign_participants_col_enrolled":"Enrolled","campaign_participants_col_cash":"Cash after claim","campaign_participants_col_matched":"Matched","campaign_participants_badge_new_user":"New user","campaign_participants_badge_paid":"Paid after claim","campaign_participants_empty":"No participants yet","campaign_row_participants":"Participants ({{count}})","redemption_waitlist_badge":"{{count}} waiting","redemption_waitlist_badge_aria":"View waitlist — {{count}} waiting","redemption_waitlist_col_email":"Email","redemption_waitlist_col_code":"Cod