ame_json}/{label_json}/{version_json} substitute as a fully quoted JSON string literal — use these inside JSON bodies so a name containing quotes or special characters cannot inject sibling fields upstream. JSON example: {\"filter\":{\"name\":{\"equals\":{name_json}}}}","prompt_provider_modal_response_json_path":"Response JSON path (optional)","prompt_source_field_response_json_path_help":"Dot-path into the response JSON where the prompt content lives. Leave empty to auto-detect top-level shapes (text / prompt / messages). Example: data.0.template.messages","prompt_provider_modal_auth_header":"Auth header name","prompt_source_field_auth_header_help":"HTTP header the secret is sent in. Leave empty for Authorization (the default). Set to X-API-KEY (or similar) for providers that use a custom header.","prompt_provider_modal_auth_scheme":"Auth scheme prefix","prompt_source_field_auth_scheme_help":"String prepended to the secret in the header value. Behavior depends on Auth header name above: if Auth header is also empty, the gateway defaults to \"Authorization: Bearer \u003csecret>\". If Auth header is set (e.g. X-API-KEY) and this field is empty, the secret is sent RAW (no prefix) — this is what most non-Bearer platforms expect. Set to \"Token \" or another prefix only if your platform documents it.","overview_traffic_routing_title":"Traffic routing","过期时间快捷设置":"Expiration time quick settings","perm_view_workspace_desc":"See prompts, keys, requests, costs, and analytics for this workspace.","渠道创建成功！":"Upstream created successfully!","marketing_max_bonus_cap_help":"The maximum (global + tier + targeted) % a single top-up can earn. 0 = uncapped. Keep this set to avoid mis-config blowouts.","任一满足（OR）":"Any match (OR)","announcement_link_label_placeholder":"Learn more","(输入 {{nonImageInput}} tokens + 图片输入 {{imageInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}}":"(Input {{nonImageInput}} tokens + Image input {{imageInput}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}}","查看示例":"View Example","该套餐未配置 Stripe":"This plan is not configured for Stripe","partner.view.settings.status":"Status","configure_microsoft_oauth_desc":"Enables login & registration via Microsoft","管理员账号已经初始化过，请继续设置其他参数":"The admin account has already been initialized, please continue to set other parameters","n8n_empty":"No webhook calls yet","将只保留最近 {{value}} 个日志文件，其余将被删除。":"Only the last {{value}} log files will be retained; the rest will be deleted.","额度充值":"Quota Top-up","若你的 OIDC Provider 支持 Discovery Endpoint，你可以仅填写 OIDC Well-Known URL，系统会自动获取 OIDC 配置":"If your OIDC Provider supports Discovery Endpoint, you can only fill in the OIDC Well-Known URL, and the system will automatically obtain the OIDC configuration","cohort_kpi_section_title":"New users by window","models_view_grid_aria":"Show models as grid","admin_workspace_drawer_section_lifecycle":"Lifecycle","描述":"Description","members_perm_card_subtitle":"What each workspace role can do. Backend RBAC is the source of truth — UI gates mirror it.","已添加 {{count}} 个模板":"Added {{count}} template(s)","令牌更新成功！":"Token updated successfully!","enterprise.saml_idp_sso_url":"IdP SSO URL","复制令牌":"Copy token","新格式（支持条件判断与json自定义）：":"New format (supports conditional judgment and JSON customization):","该供应商提供多种AI模型，适用于不同的应用场景。":"This supplier provides multiple AI models, suitable for different application scenarios.","because:":"because:","rewards_mult_sub":"Route at least one request every calendar day (UTC) for 7 consecutive days to activate the 1.25× bonus on every point you earn. One missed day resets the counter.","partner.view.payouts.need_approved":"Partner status must be approved to request a payout.","marketing_translation_col_coverage":"Coverage (✎ = manually edited)","名称不能为空":"Name cannot be empty","Codex 帐号":"Codex account","通道 ${name} 余额更新成功！":"Channel ${name} quota updated successfully!","已拉取 {{n}} 个 Arena 模型":"Fetched {{n}} Arena models","确认":"Confirm","insights_evals_guide_title":"Automatic evals — what this is","r