reset complete","邀请":"Invitations","仅用订阅":"Subscription only","项目内容":"Project content","nav_go_console":"Go to console","models_faq_pricing_live_a":"Yes. Per-token prices reflect the live upstream rate. OrcaRouter does not mark up provider pricing — what you see here is what your account is billed at request time.","pkce_revoke_hint":"You can revoke this app from the Authorized Apps page on your account.","partner.bank.field_method_type":"Payout method","转小写":"To lowercase","prompt_purge_confirm_title":"","核心配置":"Core Configuration","Telegram Bot 名称":"Telegram Bot Name","models_modality_file":"File","GitHub Client ID":"GitHub Client ID","路径正则":"Path Regex","请输入公告内容":"Please enter the notice content","错误率":"Error rate","您需要先启用两步验证或 Passkey 才能执行此操作":"You need to enable two-factor authentication or Passkey before you can perform this operation","默认测试模型":"Default Test Model","请在 Waffo 后台获取 API 密钥、商户 ID 以及 RSA 密钥对，并配置回调地址。":"Get the API key, merchant ID, and RSA key pair from the Waffo dashboard, and configure the callback URL.","重试建议":"Retry Suggestion","重复的键名":"Duplicate key name","billing.page_title":"Billing","enterprise.saml_guide_entity":"SP Entity ID (Audience / Identifier) — recommended value","暂无常见问答":"No FAQ","Insights":"Insights","请输入邮箱":"Please enter email","hero_title_zero":"Open-source","members_message_placeholder":"Hey, join our OrcaRouter workspace...","executive_daily_title":"By-day scorecard","条件项设置":"Condition Item Settings","tiered_pricing_help_sentinel":"The last tier's Max Input must be 0 (catch-all, unbounded). Without it, requests above the largest finite tier mis-bill.","prompt_webhook_delete_confirm":"Delete this webhook? Subscribers will stop receiving events immediately.","设备类型偏好":"Device Type Preference","固定价格":"Fixed Price","项":"items","health_snapshot_7d_spend":"7d $","有效期单位":"Validity Unit","高危状态码重试风险告知与免责声明Markdown":"### ⚠️ High-Risk Operation: Risk Notice and Disclaimer for 504/524 Retry\nBy default, this project does not retry for status codes `400` (bad request), `504` (gateway timeout), and `524` (timeout occurred).\n In many cases, 504 and 524 mean the request has reached the upstream AI service and processing has started, but the connection was closed due to long processing time.\n\nEnabling redirection/retry for these timeout status codes is a **high-risk operation**. Before enabling it, you must read and understand the consequences below:\n\n#### 1. Core Risks (Read Carefully)\n1. 💸 Duplicate/multiple billing risk: Most upstream AI providers **still charge** for requests that started processing but got interrupted by network timeout (504/524). If retry is triggered, a new upstream request will be sent, which can lead to **duplicate or multiple charges**.\n2. ⏳ Severe client timeout: If a single request already timed out, adding retries can multiply total latency and cause severe or unacceptable timeout behavior for your final client/caller.\n3. 💥 Request backlog and system crash risk: Forcing retries on timeout requests keeps threads and connections occupied for longer. Under high concurrency, this can cause serious backlog, exhaust system resources, trigger a cascading failure, and crash your proxy service.\n\n#### 2. Risk Acknowledgement\nIf you still choose to enable this feature, you acknowledge all of the following:","admin.partners.detail_referrals":"Referrals (activated/total)","服务器日志管理":"Server Log Management","无匹配结果":"No matches","models_banner_title":"Are you routing yet?","请输入模型名称，如：gpt-4":"Please enter the model name, such as: gpt-4","health_thresholds_load_failed":"Failed to load workspace health thresholds","how_step1_desc":"Set base_url to api.orcarouter.ai/v1 and swap your API key. No other code changes needed.","输出 Tokens":"Output tokens","获取价格列表失败":"Failed to get price list","创建密钥":"Create key","how_tag":"Setup","signup_grant_github_min_repos_label":"Min public repos","signup_grant_github_min_followers_label":"Min followers","signup_grant_allowed_countries_label":"Allowed countries (signup grant)","signup_grant_allowed_countries_helper":"Select the countries whose signups receive the grant. Leave empty to allow all countries. Gates the grant only, not registration.","signup_grant_allowed_countries_placeholder":"Search and select countries","GPU数量":"Number of GPUs","roi_col_channel":"Upstream","计费方式":"Billing Mode","填充模板":"Fill Template","Create your account":"Create your account","缓存倍率":"Cache ratio","enterprise.saml_allowed_email_domains":"Allowed email domains","partner.view.earnings.col_share":"Share","删除后无法恢复，确定要删除模型 ":"Deletion cannot be undone. Are you sure you want to delete model ","确认补单":"Confirm Order Completion","请输入金额":"Please enter amount","integrations_n8n_description":"Each URL is the Production webhook URL of an n8n workflow. O2 assembles a ready-to-render Lark interactive card and POSTs it; n8n forwards to your Lark bot (or Slack / email / CRM). Leaving a URL empty disables the matching event class.","无法获取容器详情":"Unable to get container details","integrations_crisp_website_id_placeholder":"e.g. 12345678-abcd-4e5f-9012-3456789abcde","已拉取 {{n}} 个 OpenRouter 模型":"Fetched {{n}} OpenRouter models","roi_kpi_signups":"Signups","partner.nav.payouts":"Payouts","机密环境变量说明":"Secret Environment Variables Description","billing.transaction_history_sub":"Top-ups and subscription payments.","仪表盘设置":"Dashboard","executive_kpi_paid_profit":"Paid profit","points.earn_phase2_title":"Opt into Phase 2 monetization","points.hero_max":"max","billing.voucher_empty_hint":"Enter a voucher code to redeem.","输入 {{input}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}}":"Input {{input}} tokens / 1M tokens * {{symbol}}{{price}}","marketing_cancel":"Cancel","insights_evals_edit_set":"Edit set","当前规则不支持写入到该位置":"Current rule does not support writing to this location","prompt_messages_editor_content_placeholder":"Message content…","billing.metric_projected_monthly":"Projected monthly","glass3_desc":"Difficulty grades, model choices, failover events, and health swaps are logged with timestamps. Reproduce any request's routing path.","当前状态":"Current Status","overview_model_performance_locked_title":"Unlock model performance at Surge tier","partner.view.earnings.total_window":"Total in Window","获取 Discovery 配置":"Fetch Discovery Configuration","例如 https://example.com/api/waffo/webhook":"e.g. https://example.com/api/waffo/webhook","insights_explainability_guide_body":"The full 'why was this request routed here' trace for one request: the gate's original decision (strategy, task class, difficulty, budget tier, picked model), every channel attempt and fallback, and the final outcome.","启动时间":"Startup Time","仅检测上游模型更新":"Detect upstream model updates only","admin.partner_analytics_breakdown_col_cost":"Upstream Cost","输入关键词搜索 Arena 模型":"Enter a keyword to search Arena models","models_view_grid":"Grid","prompt_label_split_sum_ok":"Sum: 100% ✓","供应商":"Provider","支持众多的大模型供应商":"Supporting various LLM providers","nav_rewards":"Rewards","promo_split_excluded_badge":"paid only","总览":"Overview","partner.view.settings.title":"Settings","授权失败":"Authorization failed","revenue_top_customers_col_last_active":"Last active","spend_drawer_delete_confirm_title":"Delete this spend entry?","模板应用失败":"Template application failed","选择充值套餐":"Choose a top-up package","insights_trace_fallback":"Fallback","members_token_delete":"Delete tokens permanently","例如：0001":"e.g.: 0001","insights_evals_judge_ph":"Search a model or router (optional)","billing.contact_sales_inline_prompt":"Pay after-the-fact with monthly invoicing by contacting our accounts team.","确认作废":"Confirm invalidation","rewards_scen_enterprise_outcome2":"Top 0.1% of revenue pool","prompt_webhook_col_enabled":"Enabled","insights_evals_set_name":"Name","自定义范围":"Custom range","保存邮箱域名白名单设置":"Save Email Domain Whitelist Settings","个GPU":" GPUs","admin.partners.edit_label_tax_form_status":"Tax form status","partner.view.payouts.empty_desc":"When your earnings exceed the minimum threshold, come back here to request one.","Credit limit (optional)":"Credit limit (optional)","OpenRouter 操作 ▾":"OpenRouter actions ▾","observability_scrape_url":"Scrape URL","guardrail_no_keys_short":"none","流量端口":"Traffic Port","额度展示类型":"Quota display type","members_you_tag":"You","guardrail_sandbox":"Test sandbox","guardrail_sandbox_dev_required":"Running the sandbox needs a Developer role or higher — it can trigger paid model checks and outbound requests.","更新配置失败":"Failed to update configuration","请输入填充值":"Please enter a value","guardrail_copy_json":"Copy policy JSON","prompt_playground_version_group":"Versions","错误类型（可选）":"Error Type (optional)","配置套餐的有效时长":"Configure the plan validity duration","not_found_title":"Page not found","暂无参数覆盖记录":"No param overrides yet","JSON编辑":"JSON Editor","rewards_why_title":"Why Points matter for developers","添加启动命令":"Add Startup Command","站点所有额度将按汇率换算为自定义货币显示":"All site quotas will be converted to custom currency using the exchange rate","自动匹配(保留手工编辑)":"Auto-match (keep manual edits)","revenue_kpi_churned_workspaces":"Churned workspaces","marketing_autopay_defaults":"Modal pre-fill","已关联 Arena 参考":"Arena reference linked","partner.view.payment_method.need_admin_role":"Only the workspace owner or admin can change the payment method. The current binding is shown read-only for other roles.","pricing_faq_1_q":"How can OrcaRouter charge $0 markup and stay in business?","pricing_faq_1_a":"OrcaRouter monetizes via subscription tiers (Hacker free, Team ${{price}}{{interval}}, Enterprise custom) for team seats, compliance and enterprise SLAs. Per-token usage is billed at the upstream provider rate with no margin added.","pricing_faq_2_q":"What is included in the free Hacker tier?","pricing_faq_2_a":"Hacker includes the full 200+ model catalog, OpenAI-compatible API, automatic failover, basic observability and a single-user workspace. Upgrade to Team for up to 10 seats, compliance enforcement & reports, unlimited API keys, and priority support.","pricing_faq_3_q":"Do you offer a free trial of the Team plan?","pricing_faq_3_a":"Yes. New workspaces get {{days}} days of Team free; cancel any time. No card is required to start on the Hacker tier.","pricing_faq_3_a_no_trial":"Not right now. The Hacker tier is free forever and needs no card, and Team is billed from the first day — cancel any time.","pricing_faq_4_q":"How do Enterprise contracts differ from Team?","pricing_faq_4_a":"Enterprise adds private / on-prem deployment, a 99.99% uptime SLA, dedicated infrastructure, dedicated support, and custom pricing. Pricing is volume-based; contact sales from the Pricing page.","pricing_faq_5_q":"Are there per-request fees on top of provider cost?","pricing_faq_5_a":"No per-request fee on Hacker or Team. Enterprise plans may include a flat per-million-token routing fee depending on volume tier.","timed_pricing_peak_badge":"Peak ×{{multiplier}}","timed_pricing_peak_hours":"Peak hours","timed_pricing_off_peak":"Off-peak","timed_pricing_calc_note":"Estimates below use the off-peak rate; peak windows multiply token prices as shown above.","timed_pricing_start_time":"Start time","timed_pricing_end_time":"End time","timed_pricing_tab_title":"Time-of-Day Pricing","timed_pricing_intro":"Configure daily peak windows per model. Inside each window token prices are multiplied by the window's factor; outside all windows the base price applies. Times are evaluated in the configured timezone.","timed_pricing_timezone":"Timezone","timed_pricing_multiplier":"Multiplier","timed_pricing_add_window":"Add Window","timed_pricing_error_invalid_window":"Window {{idx}}: enter start/end times (HH:MM, start ≠ end) and a multiplier between 0 and 100","timed_pricing_delete_confirm":"Delete time-of-day pricing for {{model}}?","pricing_faq_h2":"Frequently asked questions","pricing_about_billing_h2":"How billing works","pricing_about_billing_body":"You are billed per token at the upstream provider's published rate — the same number on OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google's own pricing page. Cached reads bill at the provider's discounted cache rate. There is no OrcaRouter token markup on any tier.","pricing_about_markup_h2":"Why zero markup","pricing_about_markup_body":"Most AI gateways add 5–20% on every token. OrcaRouter does not: token usage is pass-through, and the product is funded by the optional Team and Enterprise subscriptions, not by a margin on your spend.","pricing_about_value_h2":"What you are paying for","pricing_about_value_body":"The free Hacker tier is the full gateway — 200+ models, one OpenAI-compatible API, and automatic failover. Team and Enterprise add seats, compliance enforcement and reporting, higher rate limits, SLAs, and priority or dedicated support.","pricing_about_security_h2":"Security & compliance","pricing_about_security_body":"Every plan runs behind the same guardrails and agent firewall. Team adds compliance enforcement and audit reporting; Enterprise adds private / on-prem deployment, data-residency controls, and a 99.99% uptime SLA.","model_content_gen_scope":"Generation scope","model_content_gen_missing":"Generate missing","model_content_gen_all":"Regenerate all","model_content_gen_selected":"Generate selected ({{count}})","model_content_gen_title":"Model SEO content","model_content_gen_desc":"Generate long-form SEO content (overview, use cases, FAQ) for every published model using the configured marketing-translation LLM. Each model's content is then localized to all languages automatically.","model_content_gen_btn":"Generate SEO content","model_content_gen_running":"Generating…","model_content_gen_refresh":"Refresh","model_content_gen_started":"Content generation started","model_content_gen_already_running":"Content generation already running","model_content_gen_not_configured":"Configure the marketing-translation model and API key (above) first.","model_content_gen_progress":"{{processed}} / {{total}} processed","model_content_gen_counts":"{{generated}} generated · {{skipped}} skipped · {{failed}} failed","model_content_gen_last_error":"Last error: {{error}}","model_tab_overview":"Overview","model_tab_capabilities":"Capabilities","model_tab_benchmarks":"Benchmarks","model_tab_pricing":"Pricing","model_tab_api":"Using the API","model_tab_compare":"Comparison","model_sections_aria":"Model details","model_get_api_cta":"Get the {{name}} API","price_title_line1":"Routing is free.","数据库警告":"Database warning","同步向导":"Sync Wizard","partner.become.step3_desc":"Earn {{share_pct}}% of every referred workspace's spend, paid monthly.","pricing pending":"pricing pending","marketing_save_failed":"save failed","查看":"Check","models_faq_model_count_q":"How many AI models does OrcaRouter support?","executive_drill_dim_a":"Break down by","活跃":"Active","Arena 自动匹配":"Arena auto-match","partner.nav.sidebar_entry":"Partner","refer_friends":"Refer friends","promo_slot_refer_msg":"Know someone building with AI? Refer them to OrcaRouter","offers_bonus_applied":"Best rate across one-time top-ups and credit subscriptions — shown at checkout in Add credits","offers_refer_cta":"Share","models_card_copied":"Copied","lambda_override_label":"λ override","加载分组失败":"Failed to load groups","已有模型":"Existing Models","暂无机密环境变量":"No secret environment variables","announcement_end_at_label":"Auto-hide after (optional)","revenue_kpi_current_mrr":"Current MRR","搜索供应商":"Search vendor","auth_code_sent":"Verification code sent. Please check your inbox.","支付失败":"Payment failed","points.metric_next_tier":"Next tier","error_boundary_retry_exhausted_body":"Reloading once didn't help — the new build may still be propagating. Wait a moment and try again, or contact support if this keeps happening.","admin.analytics.col_referred":"Referred","tier_match_count":"{{matched}} of {{total}} allowed models in this tier","订阅剩余":"Subscription Remaining","lifecycle_timeline_aria":"Workspace lifecycle events","启用用户模型请求速率限制（可能会影响高并发性能）":"Enable user model request rate limit (may affect high concurrency performanc