 least 1 hour","spend_drawer_period_required":"Date is required","billing.change_plan_btn":"Change plan","启用 Prompt 检查":"Enable Prompt check","profile_section_personal_desc":"Your name and account identifiers","admin_workspaces_filter_health":"Health","prompt_playground_vars_custom_add":"Add","pkce_bad_method":"Unsupported code_challenge_method. Use S256 or plain.","系统性能监控":"System Performance Monitoring","键为用户分组名称，值为操作映射对象。内层键以\"+:\"开头表示添加指定分组（键值为分组名称，值为描述），以\"-:\"开头表示移除指定分组（键值为分组名称），不带前缀的键直接添加该分组。例如：{\"vip\": {\"+:premium\": \"高级分组\", \"special\": \"特殊分组\", \"-:default\": \"默认分组\"}}，表示 vip 分组的用户可以使用 premium 和 special 分组，同时移除 default 分组的访问权限":"Keys are user group names and values are operation mappings. Inner keys prefixed with \"+:\" add the specified group (key is the group name, value is the description); keys prefixed with \"-:\" remove the specified group; keys without a prefix add that group directly. Example: {\"vip\": {\"+:premium\": \"Advanced group\", \"special\": \"Special group\", \"-:default\": \"Default group\"}} means vip users can access the premium and special groups while removing access to the default group.","marketing_translation_model":"Model","marketing_translation_pick_model":"Pick a cheap model…","marketing_translation_custom_model":"Custom model name…","marketing_translation_hint_click_tag":"Click any language tag to override that translation manually.","marketing_translation_override_title":"Edit translation","marketing_translation_override_lang":"Language","marketing_translation_override_save":"Save","marketing_translation_override_cancel":"Cancel","marketing_translation_override_placeholder":"Translated text. Leave blank to force source-text fallback while keeping the manual lock.","marketing_translation_override_manual_note":"Saving marks this slot as manually edited so the auto job will not overwrite it. Empty text falls back to the source.","marketing_translation_override_saved":"Manual translation saved","marketing_translation_override_reset_btn":"Reset to auto","marketing_translation_override_reset":"Slot reset — next batch will re-translate","fetch_aa_benchmarks":"Fetch AA benchmarks","fetch_designarena_benchmarks":"Fetch Design Arena benchmarks","marketing_start":"Start","keys_created_copy_failed":"Couldn't copy to clipboard. Select the text manually and copy before closing — the full key won't be shown again.","留空则使用默认端点；支持 {path, method}":"Leave blank to use the default endpoint; supports {path, method}","common.changeLanguage":"Change Language","默认补全倍率":"Default completion ratio","填入路径":"Fill Path","workspace_cancel":"Cancel","insights_evals_col_output":"Output","测试":"Test","购买订阅获得模型额度/次数":"Purchase a subscription to get model quota/usage","发布时间":"Publish Time","该渠道已开启请求透传：参数覆写、模型重定向、渠道适配等 NewAPI 内置功能将失效，非最佳实践；如因此产生问题，请勿提交 issue 反馈。":"Request pass-through is enabled for this upstream. Built-in NewAPI features such as parameter overrides, model redirection, and upstream adaptation will be disabled. This is not a best practice. If this causes issues, please do not submit an issue.","show_more":"Show more","admin_workspaces_col_acquisition_none":"(none)","guardrail_v1_notice":"Live enforcement: input rules; output block rules on both non-streaming and streaming OpenAI-format responses (chat-completions, Responses API, Responses→Chat). Streaming mask rules and end-of-stream (external/judge) blocks degrade to audit-only — recorded but not removed from the response. Audio TTS streams remain unscanned (binary).","guardrail_pii_entity_email":"Email","guardrail_pii_entity_phone":"Phone","guardrail_pii_entity_credit_card":"Credit card","guardrail_pii_entity_ssn":"SSN","guardrail_pii_entity_ip":"IP address","guardrail_pii_entity_iban":"IBAN","guardrail_pii_entity_mac_address":"MAC address","guardrail_pii_entity_api_key_openai":"OpenAI API key","guardrail_pii_entity_aws_access_key":"AWS access key","guardrail_pii_entity_jwt":"JWT token","guardrail_pii_entity_bitcoin_address":"Bitcoin address","邀请新用户