. The action fails if any user is still assigned to it — reassign those users first.","admin_roles.delete_ok":"Role deleted","admin_roles.no_access_title":"Root only","admin_roles.no_access_desc":"This page is only accessible to root users.","admin_roles.save":"Save","admin_roles.save_ok":"Role updated","admin_roles.editor_title":"Edit role: {{slug}}","admin_roles.field_name":"Name","admin_roles.field_description":"Description","admin_roles.field_mfa":"Require 2FA at login for users in this role","admin_roles.immutable_hint":"Root template is locked to the full capability set; capabilities cannot be edited.","role.root.name":"Root","role.root.desc":"Full system access; cannot be edited or deleted.","role.admin.name":"Admin","role.admin.desc":"Operational admin across customers, finance, marketing, and ops — minus system settings and role assignment.","role.sales_leader.name":"Sales leader","role.sales_leader.desc":"Full sales visibility across reps, quotas, leaderboard, and customer accounts.","role.sales.name":"Sales rep","role.sales.desc":"Own leads and accounts; reads the sales leaderboard.","role.marketing.name":"Marketing","role.marketing.desc":"Campaign-side content, partners, broadcasts, and revenue-side dashboards.","role.finance.name":"Finance","role.finance.desc":"10-cycle finance report, refunds, top-ups, redemptions, and wallet adjustments.","role.ops.name":"Platform ops","role.ops.desc":"Channels, models, logs, routing, monitoring — the upstream-facing operator role.","role.executive.name":"Executive","role.executive.desc":"Board / C-level read-only access across every dashboard. No writes.","cap_domain.system":"System","cap_domain.users":"Users","cap_domain.customers":"Customers","cap_domain.sales":"Sales","cap_domain.revenue":"Revenue","cap_domain.finance":"Finance","cap_domain.marketing":"Marketing","cap_domain.ops":"Platform ops","cap.system.settings.write.label":"Write system settings","cap.system.settings.write.desc":"Edit /api/option (OAuth provi