ding the discovery inventory. Try again.","firewall_discovered_col_attributed":"Attributed keys","firewall_discovered_search_ph":"Search tools","firewall_discovered_search_aria":"Search tools","firewall_discovered_filter_surface_aria":"Filter by surface","firewall_discovered_filter_surface_all":"All surfaces","firewall_discovered_gaps_only":"Gaps only","firewall_approvals_error_title":"Couldn’t load approvals","firewall_approvals_error_body":"Something went wrong loading the approvals queue. Try again.","firewall_approvals_empty_body":"Nothing waiting on you. Held tool calls land here the moment a rule asks for your sign-off.","firewall_mcp_error_title":"Couldn’t load MCP servers","firewall_mcp_error_body":"Something went wrong loading the registered MCP servers. Try again.","firewall_policies_error_title":"Couldn’t load policies","firewall_policies_error_body":"Something went wrong loading your firewall policies. Try again.","firewall_events_no_matches":"No events match the current filters.","firewall_discovered_no_matches":"No tools match the current filters.","firewall_held_because_policy":"Held because: matches \"{{policy}}\"","firewall_held_because_rule":"Held because: {{rule}}","firewall_held_rule_changed":"(rule has changed since this was held)","firewall_promote_block_aria":"Block {{tool}}","firewall_promote_just_watch_aria":"Just watch {{tool}}","firewall_section_policies":"Policies","firewall_section_sources":"Sources","firewall_tab_today":"Today","firewall_tab_rules":"Rules","firewall_today_snapshot_heading":"Last hour","firewall_tile_allowed":"allowed","firewall_tile_blocked":"blocked","firewall_tile_errors":"errors","firewall_tile_text_safety":"Text safety","firewall_today_approvals_heading":"Awaiting your approval","firewall_today_denies_heading":"Recent denies","firewall_today_newtools_heading":"New tools spotted","firewall_today_see_all":"See all","firewall_today_denies_error_title":"Couldn’t load recent blocks","firewall_today_denies_error_body":"Something went wrong loading recent blocks. Try again.","firewall_today_newtools_error_title":"Couldn’t load new tools","firewall_today_newtools_error_body":"Something went wrong loading newly-spotted tools. Try again.","firewall_today_newtools_empty_title":"No new tools spotted","firewall_today_newtools_empty_body":"Watching for tools your agents call. Anything new shows up here so you can wave it through or block it.","firewall_autonomy_sim_checking":"Checking impact…","firewall_autonomy_sim_blast":"Would have blocked {{count}} tool calls in the last {{days}} days.","firewall_activity_preset_aria":"Activity preset","firewall_today_approvals_refresh":"Refresh queue","firewall_today_denies_empty":"Nothing blocked recently. Denied tool calls show up here the moment a rule turns one away.","firewall_today_deny_no_policy":"no policy","firewall_today_newtool_calls":"{{count}} calls","firewall_events_viewer_title":"Activity is developer-only","firewall_events_viewer_body":"Ask a workspace developer or owner for access to the firewall activity stream.","firewall_activity_preset_all":"All","firewall_activity_preset_denies":"Denies + holds","firewall_activity_preset_tools_without_rules":"Tools without rules","firewall_activity_group_by_family":"Group by family","firewall_activity_group_by_source":"Group by source","firewall_activity_source_unattributed":"(unattributed)","firewall_artifact_kind_mcp_server":"MCP server","firewall_artifact_kind_plugin":"Plugin","firewall_artifact_kind_skill":"Skill","firewall_artifact_inferred_manifest":"Inferred from observed behavior — not the vendor manifest","firewall_mcp_editor_title_edit":"Edit MCP server","firewall_mcp_editor_title_new":"Register MCP server","firewall_mcp_register":"Register MCP server","firewall_plugin_editor_title_edit":"Edit plugin","firewall_plugin_editor_title_new":"Register plugin","firewall_plugin_register":"Register plugin","firewall_today_newskills_more":"{{count}} more →","firewall_held_for_review":"Held for review","firewall_family_shell":"Shell","firewall_family_database":"Database","firewall_family_http":"Web","firewall_family_filesystem":"File system","firewall_family_messaging":"Messaging","firewall_family_payments":"Payments","firewall_family_crm":"CRM","firewall_family_code":"Code","firewall_family_search":"Search","firewall_family_cron":"Schedule","firewall_family_other":"Other","firewall_family_count":"{{family}} · {{count}} new","firewall_tile_pending":"awaiting you","firewall_tile_text_safety_sub":"Open Guardrails →","firewall_today_family_header":"{{family}} · {{count}} new","firewall_section_skills":"Skills","firewall_skill_register":"Register skill","firewall_skill_edit":"Edit","firewall_skill_col_risk":"Risk","firewall_skill_col_name":"Skill","firewall_skill_col_source":"Source","firewall_skill_col_scan":"Scan","firewall_skill_col_tools":"Tools","firewall_skill_breakdown":"{{read}} read · {{write}} write · {{exec}} exec · {{network}} network","firewall_skills_empty_title":"No skills registered","firewall_skills_empty_body":"Register a skill to scan its manifest and govern which tools your agents can load.","firewall_skills_error_title":"Couldn’t load skills","firewall_skills_error_body":"Something went wrong loading registered skills. Try again.","firewall_skill_editor_title_new":"Register skill","firewall_skill_editor_title_edit":"Edit skill","firewall_skill_name_label":"Name","firewall_skill_name_ph":"e.g. invoice-tools","firewall_skill_version_label":"Version","firewall_skill_version_ph":"e.g. 1.0.0","firewall_skill_source_label":"Source","firewall_skill_source_ph":"e.g. github.com/acme/invoice-tools","firewall_skill_source_registry":"registry","firewall_skill_source_private":"private","firewall_skill_source_builtin":"builtin","firewall_skill_source_byo_mcp":"BYO MCP","firewall_skill_source_auto_detected":"auto-detected","firewall_skill_source_url_label":"Source URL","firewall_skill_source_url_ph":"e.g. github.com/acme/invoice-tools","firewall_skill_manifest_label":"Manifest","firewall_skill_manifest_ph":"Paste the skill manifest (JSON) — tools, permissions, metadata.","firewall_skill_manifest_required":"A manifest is required to register a skill.","firewall_skill_manifest_help":"The manifest is the skill package descriptor (name, tool list, permissions, metadata). It is scanned, never executed — the scanner reads it for prompt-injection, tool-creep and network signals. The \"Allowed tools\" and scope fields below are what you DECLARE as the allowlist; the scan compares what the manifest mentions against them.","firewall_skill_manifest_example_btn":"Insert example","firewall_skill_mode_label":"Mode","firewall_skill_mode_allow":"Allow","firewall_skill_mode_block":"Block","firewall_skill_mode_quarantine":"Quarantine","firewall_skill_mode_hint":"Allow loads the skill freely. Quarantine loads it but holds every tool call for approval. Block prevents it loading at all.","firewall_skill_requires_approval_label":"Require approval on every load","firewall_skill_save_edit":"Save","firewall_skill_saved":"Skill registered","firewall_skill_rescan":"Re-scan","firewall_skill_rescanned":"Skill re-scanned","firewall_skill_review":"Review","firewall_skill_allowed_tools_label":"Allowed tools","firewall_skill_allowed_tools_ph":"One tool name per line (e.g. shell.exec). Calls to these tools are attributed to this skill for enforcement.","firewall_skill_block_aria":"Block {{skill}}","firewall_skill_watch_aria":"Just watch {{skill}}","firewall_skill_review_aria":"Review {{skill}}","firewall_skill_scan_clean":"Clean","firewall_skill_scan_flagged":"Flagged","firewall_skill_scan_blocked":"Blocked","firewall_skill_scan_pending":"Not scanned yet","firewall_skill_scan_no_findings":"No issues found in this manifest.","firewall_skill_severity_error":"Errors","firewall_skill_severity_warn":"Warnings","firewall_skill_severity_info":"Info","firewall_skill_finding_prompt_injection":"Prompt injection","firewall_skill_finding_tool_creep":"Tool creep","firewall_skill_finding_network_egress":"Network egress","firewall_skill_finding_fs_write_unsafe":"Unsafe file write","firewall_skill_finding_unsigned":"Unsigned manifest","firewall_risk_band_low":"Low risk","firewall_risk_band_medium":"Medium risk","firewall_risk_band_high":"High risk","firewall_risk_band_critical":"Critical risk","firewall_today_anomalies_heading":"Anomalies","firewall_today_anomalies_error_title":"Couldn’t load anomalies","firewall_today_anomalies_error_body":"Something went wrong loading behavioural anomalies. Try again.","firewall_anomaly_rate_spike":"{{tool}} called {{count}}× from {{token}} (baseline {{baseline}}/5m · z={{z}})","firewall_anomaly_burn_spike":"budget burn spiked: {{tool}} {{count}}× from {{token}} (baseline {{baseline}}/5m · z={{z}})","firewall_anomaly_investigate":"Investigate","firewall_anomaly_snooze":"Snooze 1h","firewall_anomaly_snoozed_toast":"Anomalies snoozed for 1 hour","firewall_anomaly_unknown_token":"unknown key","firewall_today_newskills_heading":"New skills spotted","firewall_today_newskills_error_title":"Couldn’t load new skills","firewall_today_newskills_error_body":"Something went wrong loading newly-spotted skills. Try again.","acquisition_tab_link_builder":"Tag a link","acquisition_link_builder_title":"Campaign link builder","acquisition_link_builder_desc":"Add utm_* tags to a campaign link so signups from it are attributed instead of landing in the \"(unknown)\" bucket. utm_source is the minimum worth setting.","acquisition_link_builder_base":"Destination URL","acquisition_link_builder_result":"Tagged URL","acquisition_link_builder_copy":"Copy","acquisition_link_builder_copied":"Copied","acquisition_link_builder_copy_failed":"Copy failed","acquisition_link_builder_hint":"Untagged links can still be partially attributed via the referrer (the \"Channel (resolved)\" dimension) or ad click-IDs (gclid/fbclid), but explicit utm_* tags are the most reliable.","acquisition_dimension_signup_utm_term":"UTM term","acquisition_dimension_signup_utm_content":"UTM content","admin_user_drawer_utm_term":"UTM term","admin_user_drawer_utm_content":"UTM content","admin_user_drawer_click_ids":"Click IDs","roi_dimension_signup_utm_term":"UTM term","roi_dimension_signup_utm_content":"UTM content","executive_dim_signup_utm_term":"UTM term","executive_dim_signup_utm_content":"UTM content","acquisition_dimension_signup_channel":"Channel (resolved)","routing_dsl_help_menu_aria":"Open help menu","routing_dsl_worked_title":"How routing rules work","routing_dsl_worked_code_label":"Example ruleset","routing_dsl_worked_summary":"In plain English: difficult coding tasks go to a frontier model; very long prompts go to a long-context model; everything else uses the balanced strategy.","routing_dsl_worked_annot_order":"Rules are tried top-to-bottom — the first rule whose when: is true wins.","routing_dsl_worked_annot_when":"when: is a CEL test over request signals (task class, difficulty, tokens, agent state).","routing_dsl_worked_annot_default":"No rule matched? The default: block decides — a strategy or a model.","routing_dsl_worked_starter_note":"The example shows real model names for clarity; adopting it inserts orcarouter/auto as a safe placeholder — swap in your own models with Insert › Model.","routing_dsl_worked_use_btn":"Use as starting point","routing_dsl_worked_hide":"Hide","routing_dsl_worked_reopen":"Show worked example","routing_dsl_empty_title":"Start a routing strategy","routing_dsl_empty_desc":"Route each request to the right model. Pick how you want to begin:","routing_dsl_empty_template_title":"From a template","routing_dsl_empty_template_desc":"Proven starting points, mapped to your workspace models.","routing_dsl_empty_template_btn":"Browse templates","routing_dsl_empty_generate_title":"Generate with AI","routing_dsl_empty_generate_desc":"Describe the routing in plain English; we ground it in your models.","routing_dsl_empty_generate_btn":"Open generator","routing_dsl_empty_generate_secondary":"Prefer plain English? Save the router once, then use Generate with AI to draft it.","routing_dsl_empty_scratch_title":"From scratch","routing_dsl_empty_scratch_desc":"Start with a one-rule skeleton and build up.","routing_dsl_empty_scratch_btn":"Insert a starter rule","routing_dsl_empty_doors_intro":"A rule's use: routes to one of three things:","routing_dsl_empty_door_model":"One model","routing_dsl_empty_door_pool":"A group — a pool or another router","routing_dsl_empty_door_delegate":"A built-in strategy (balanced, cheapest…)","routing_dsl_group_author":"Author","routing_dsl_group_check":"Check","routing_dsl_group_diagnose":"Diagnose","routing_dsl_tip_load_template":"Proven starting points, mapped to your models","routing_dsl_tip_insert":"Insert a model, pool, or router at the cursor","routing_dsl_tip_generate":"Describe the routing in words; AI drafts it","routing_dsl_tip_explain":"Plain-English summary of this ruleset","routing_dsl_tip_lint":"Structure and policy check","routing_dsl_tip_dryrun":"Simulate one request (no save needed)","routing_dsl_tip_history":"Past versions and rollback","routing_dsl_tip_tests":"Save expected rule-to-model cases","routing_dsl_tip_trace":"Replay a real request's routing","billing.pay_with_crypto":"Pay with crypto (USDT)","billing.pay_method_card":"Card","billing.pay_method_crypto":"Crypto (USDT)","billing.account_settings_eyebrow":"Payment & top-up","billing_tab_topup":"Add credits","billing_tab_mysubs":"My plans","billing_tab_settings":"Settings","billing_tab_history":"History","subscription_autorenew_short":"Auto-charged each period · cancel anytime","add_credits_section_title":"Add credits","billing.addcredits_onetime_title":"One-time top-up","billing.addcredits_subscription_title":"Subscribe & save more","billing.addcredits_tab_onetime":"One-time","billing.addcredits_tab_subscription":"Subscription","topup_subscription_saves_more":"Saves more","billing.voucher_inline_label":"Have a voucher code?","billing_section_more":"More","billing.add_credits_min_hint":"Minimum ${{min}}. You'll be redirected to Stripe to complete payment.","billing.add_credits_min_hint_crypto":"Minimum ${{min}}. You'll be redirected to NOWPayments to pay with USDT.","buy_credits":"Buy Credits","buy_credits_description":"One-time top-up. Credits never expire.","starter_tier":"Starter","bigger_reward":"Bigger top-up · bigger reward","best_value":"Best","custom_amount":"Custom amount","get_credited":"Get ${{amount}}","add_credits_btn":"Add Credits","billing_section_overview":"Overview","billing_section_add_credits":"Add credits","billing_section_plans":"Plans","billing_section_history":"History","subscription_no_active_hint":"No active subscription. Subscription plans automatically credit your wallet each period.","subscription_history_count":"({{n}} past subscription(s))","subscription_days_left_one":"{{count}} day left","subscription_days_left_other":"{{count}} days left","subscription_stripe_unavailable":"Subscription checkout is currently unavailable","subscription_per_period":"/period","subscription_detail_started":"Started","subscription_detail_next_billing":"Next billing","subscription_detail_amount":"Amount","subscription_manage":"Manage subscription","subscription_canceling":"Canceling","subscription_cancels_on":"Cancels on","subscription_no_stripe_price":"This plan has no Stripe price configured","subscription_pay_failed":"Payment failed","subscription_pay_request_failed":"Payment request failed","promo_banner_up_to":"Get up to +{{pct}}% extra credit","promo_banner_cta":"Top up","promo_banner_dismiss":"Dismiss","conversion_runway":"~{{d}} days of credit left","conversion_near_quota":"You're running low on credit","conversion_topup_promo":"top up now and get","conversion_upgrade":"You've hit your plan limit — upgrade for more","conversion_cta_topup":"Top up","conversion_cta_see_plans":"See plans","subscription_dur_year_one":"year","subscription_dur_year_other":"years","subscription_dur_month_one":"month","subscription_dur_month_other":"months","subscription_dur_day_one":"day","subscription_dur_day_other":"days","subscription_dur_hour_one":"hour","subscription_dur_hour_other":"hours","subscription_dur_second_one":"second","subscription_dur_second_other":"seconds","subscription_reset_day_one":"day","subscription_reset_day_other":"days","subscription_reset_hour_one":"hour","subscription_reset_hour_other":"hours","subscription_reset_minute_one":"minute","subscription_reset_minute_other":"minutes","subscription_reset_second_one":"second","subscription_reset_second_other":"seconds","subscription_pay_get_promo":"Pay {{pay}}, get {{credited}}","subscription_get_promo":"Get {{credited}}","subscription_wallet_credit":"{{credited}} to your wallet","subscription_bonus_pct_paren":"(+{{pct}}%)","subscription_autorenew_inline":"{{price}} auto-charged every {{period}}, cancel anytime","subscription_purchase_autorenew_notice_detail":"Stripe auto-charges {{price}} every {{period}}; the first period is charged now and {{credited}} lands in your wallet immediately; cancel anytime in subscription management.","credit_subscription_title":"Subscription plans","credit_subscription_description":"Subscribe monthly, credits auto-deposit to your wallet each period","credit_subscription_preference_updated":"Updated","credit_subscription_preference_update_failed":"Update failed","marketing_plan_group_credit":"Credit subscription plans","marketing_plan_group_upgrade":"Team upgrade plans","marketing_plan_new":"New plan","marketing_plan_edit":"Edit","billing.payment_history_bonus_inline":"+${{amount}} bonus","routing_dsl_insert_channel":"Channel…","routing_dsl_insert_channel_phase4_tip":"Channel pinning lands in Phase 4 — use Model or Pool for now.","subscription_plan_type":"Plan Type","subscription_plan_type_help":"Credit wallet: credits quota + bonus into the wallet each period (Stripe recurring only). Group upgrade: bumps the user group after purchase (existing behavior).","subscription_plan_type_group_upgrade":"Group Upgrade","subscription_plan_type_credit_wallet":"Credit Wallet","subscription_plan_billing_immutable_hint":"Billing fields are locked after creation (price / total quota / duration / currency / Stripe Price / Creem / plan type / upgrade group / quota reset) — the bound Stripe Price is itself immutable. To re-price, create a new plan and disable the old one. Only title / subtitle / sort / purchase limit / enabled can be changed here.","subscription_bonus_badge":"bonus","subscription_credited_label":"Credited","subscription_credited_now_note":"Lands in your wallet now","subscription_autorenew_hint":"Auto-renews","subscription_autorenew_tip":"Auto-charged via Stripe each period; cancel anytime in subscription management.","subscription_purchase_autorenew_notice":"This is a recurring subscription — Stripe auto-charges each period (first period now); quota + bonus credit to your wallet balance immediately. Cancel anytime in subscription management.","marketing_bonus_scope":"Bonus scope","marketing_bonus_scope_help":"Which channels the steady-state bonus (amount tiers + targeted rules) applies to. The limited-time global promo above keeps its own applies_to scope and stays independent of these toggles.","marketing_bonus_scope_manual":"Manual top-up","marketing_bonus_scope_subscription":"Credit subscription","marketing_global_promo_scope":"Applies to","marketing_global_promo_scope_both":"Both","subscription_period_credit_label":"Per-period credit","firewall_activity_group_by_aria":"Group activity by","firewall_activity_group_none":"None","firewall_activity_group_source":"Source","firewall_activity_group_run":"Run","firewall_activity_group_session":"Session","firewall_activity_rollup_col_run":"Run","firewall_activity_rollup_col_session":"Session","firewall_activity_rollup_col_verdicts":"Verdicts","firewall_activity_rollup_col_events":"Events","firewall_activity_rollup_col_tools":"Tools","firewall_activity_rollup_col_models":"Models","firewall_activity_rollup_col_first":"First seen","firewall_activity_rollup_col_last":"Last seen","firewall_activity_rollup_col_actions":"Actions","firewall_activity_rollup_drillin":"View events →","firewall_activity_rollup_drillin_aria":"View events for {{key}}","firewall_activity_rollup_no_matches":"No runs or sessions match the current filters.","firewall_activity_desktop_notify":"Desktop alerts when a tool call needs your approval","firewall_activity_desktop_notify_denied":"Notifications are blocked in your browser settings.","firewall_approval_held_notice":"{{tool}} is held for approval","firewall_approval_held_notice_generic":"A tool call is held for approval","firewall_verdict_short_allow":"allow","firewall_verdict_short_deny":"deny","firewall_verdict_short_pending_approval":"held","firewall_verdict_short_sanitize":"sanitize","firewall_verdict_short_audit":"audit","marketing_tab_upsell_help":"The \"Or subscribe…\" CTA that appears next to top-up. Disable to hide the recurring upsell everywhere (in-app + email). Two copy templates: winner (high-confidence \"saves X%\") and soft (\"considering a plan?\") — both support {{title}}, {{price}}, {{pct}}, {{monthly_usd}}, {{monthly_credit}}.","marketing_soft_copy_tpl":"Soft variant (no clear winner)","marketing_soft_placeholder":"Working with a team? {{title}} gives shared credit + member seats.","marketing_preview":"Preview:","marketing_tab_upsell":"Subscription upsell","marketing_winner_placeholder":"At ${{monthly_usd}}/mo, {{title}} saves ≈ {{pct}}% vs top-ups","marketing_subscription_upsell_help":"Controls the \"Or subscribe…\" CTA shown next to top-up in-app and in promo email. Two variants — winner (\"saves X%/mo\" for users whose burn beats top-up) and soft (\"considering a plan?\" for everyone else).","marketing_winner_copy_tpl":"Winner variant (beats top-up)","marketing_enable_upsell":"Enable subscription upsell","marketing_soft_presets":"Quick fill:","marketing_empty_default":"Empty = built-in default.","marketing_subscription_upsell":"Subscription upsell","compliance_nav":"Compliance","compliance_coverage_help":"Each clause maps to a runtime control. Installing a framework auto-configures its recommended rules; gaps are disclosed, never hidden. Click any row to set it up, edit it, or see how to comply.","compliance_legend_label":"What the states mean","compliance_legend_observe":"Logging only — not blocking yet","compliance_legend_covered":"Enforced — blocking in production","compliance_legend_gap":"No automated control — set up or document","compliance_legend_drift":"Rule edited since install — re-review","compliance_gap_org_note":"Organizational control — satisfied by process, evidenced in your report.","compliance_why_aria":"Why {{name}} matters","compliance_plane_org":"Organizational","compliance_review_rule":"Review →","compliance_setup_rule":"Set up →","compliance_setup_rule_label":"Set up the rule for {{id}}","compliance_gap_guidance_btn":"How to comply","compliance_gap_guidance_label":"How to comply with {{id}}","compliance_gap_guidance_title":"How to comply","compliance_gap_guidance_body":"This is an organizational control — it can’t be enforced at the gateway. Document the process you follow, then attach the evidence to your report. OrcaRouter discloses it as a gap so your posture stays honest, never silently “100% compliant”.","compliance_guidance_done":"Got it","compliance_upgrade_title":"Compliance is a paid feature","compliance_upgrade_body":"Installing {{name}} auto-configures its controls, tracks coverage continuously, and generates auditor-ready evidence. Upgrade to a paid plan to enable it.","compliance_upgrade_body_generic":"Installing a framework auto-configures its controls, tracks coverage continuously, and generates auditor-ready evidence. Upgrade to a paid plan to get started.","compliance_upgrade_feature_1":"Auto-configured guardrail & firewall rules per framework","compliance_upgrade_feature_2":"Continuous coverage tracking & drift detection","compliance_upgrade_feature_3":"Auditor-ready evidence reports (PDF / CSV / JSON)","compliance_upgrade_dismiss":"Maybe later","compliance_upgrade_aria":"Upgrade to unlock compliance","compliance_upgrade_btn":"Upgrade plan","compliance_fw_upgrade_aria":"Upgrade to install {{name}}","compliance_fw_upgrade_install":"Upgrade to install","compliance_library_sub_free":"Compliance is a paid feature. Upgrade to install frameworks, auto-configure controls, and generate evidence reports.","compliance_report_logo_note":"Every report is branded with the OrcaRouter logo and carries a SHA-256 content hash for tamper-evidence.","compliance_clause_ref_tip":"{{clause}} — open the source text","compliance_residency_label":"Data residency","compliance_residency_region_us":"United States","compliance_residency_region_eu":"European Union (EEA)","compliance_residency_region_uk":"United Kingdom","compliance_residency_region_ap":"Asia-Pacific","compliance_residency_region_cn":"China","compliance_residency_region_global":"Global / no restriction","compliance_fw_desc_hipaa":"Protected Health Information safeguards for prompts, outputs, tool egress and audit logging.","compliance_fw_desc_pci_dss":"Cardholder-data protection: PAN masking, secret hygiene and dangerous-tool controls.","compliance_fw_desc_gdpr":"Personal-data minimisation, special-category handling, transfer evidencing and processing records.","compliance_fw_desc_soc2":"Security, confidentiality and monitoring evidence for the Trust Services Criteria.","compliance_fw_desc_eu_ai_act":"Prohibited-practice guards, transparency disclosure and record-keeping for AI systems.","compliance_fw_desc_nist_ai_rmf":"Map/Measure/Manage controls: injection defence, content safety and logging.","compliance_fw_desc_owasp_llm":"The high-signal LLM security risks: injection, insecure output, disclosure, prompt leak, excessive agency.","compliance_fw_desc_iso_27001":"Annex A controls: access, cryptography/secret hygiene and event logging.","compliance_fw_desc_iso_42001":"AI management-system evidence: safety guards, user information and monitoring.","compliance_fw_desc_china_pipl":"Resident-ID protection, personal-information handling, content safety and cross-border evidencing.","compliance_fw_desc_ccpa":"Consumer personal-information and sensitive-PI protection with recordkeeping.","compliance_fw_desc_uk_gdpr":"UK personal-data minimisation, special-category handling and processing records.","compliance_fw_desc_appi_jp":"My Number protection and personal-information handling for Japan.","compliance_fw_desc_pipa_kr":"Resident Registration Number protection and personal-information minimisation for Korea.","compliance_fw_desc_lgpd_br":"Personal and sensitive-data protection with processing records for Brazil.","compliance_fw_cat_all":"All","compliance_fw_cat_ai":"AI","compliance_fw_cat_privacy":"Privacy","compliance_fw_cat_security":"Security","compliance_fw_cat_healthcare":"Healthcare","compliance_fw_cat_financial":"Financial","compliance_fw_cat_aria":"Filter frameworks by category","compliance_fw_desc_pipeda_ca":"Canadian personal-information protection: minimisation, safeguards, cross-border accountability and breach recordkeeping (PIPEDA + Quebec Law 25).","compliance_fw_desc_dpdp_in":"India Digital Personal Data Protection: data-principal minimisation, purpose limitation and processing records.","compliance_fw_desc_privacy_au":"Australian Privacy Principles: collection minimisation, sensitive-information handling, security and cross-border disclosure.","compliance_fw_desc_pdpa_sg":"Singapore PDPA: consent-based personal-data protection, security safeguards and transfer limitation.","compliance_fw_desc_vcdpa_va":"Virginia consumer data protection: personal + sensitive-data controls with processing records.","compliance_fw_desc_cpa_co":"Colorado consumer privacy: personal + sensitive-data protection, opt-out and recordkeeping.","compliance_fw_desc_ctdpa_ct":"Connecticut data privacy: personal + sensitive-data controls with processing records.","compliance_fw_desc_ucpa_ut":"Utah consumer privacy: personal + sensitive-data protection with recordkeeping.","compliance_fw_desc_tdpsa_tx":"Texas data privacy & security: personal + sensitive-data controls with processing records.","compliance_fw_desc_dora_eu":"EU Digital Operational Resilience: ICT-risk logging, monitoring, secret hygiene and third-party egress evidencing for financial entities.","compliance_fw_desc_glba":"Gramm-Leach-Bliley safeguards: financial personal-information protection, secret hygiene and recordkeeping.","compliance_fw_desc_nist_800_53":"NIST SP 800-53 / FedRAMP controls: access, cryptography/secret hygiene, audit logging and system integrity.","compliance_fw_desc_cmmc":"CMMC 2.0: controlled-information access, audit logging and dangerous-tool restrictions for the defense base.","compliance_fw_desc_hitrust":"HITRUST CSF: PHI safeguards, access, audit logging and transmission security (healthcare).","compliance_fw_desc_ferpa":"FERPA: education-record (student PII) protection with disclosure recordkeeping.","compliance_fw_desc_coppa":"COPPA: children's personal-information protection and recordkeeping; child-safety screening is an organizational gap.","compliance_fw_desc_colorado_ai":"Colorado AI Act: automated high-risk-AI record-keeping; transparency and algorithmic-discrimination safeguards are organizational gaps.","compliance_residency_hint":"The region your compliance evidence is stamped to and stored in — cross-region downloads are denied. Upstream model providers process data in their own regions, which the report discloses (the gateway does not geo-pin inference).","compliance_residency_unset":"Unspecified","compliance_residency_saved":"Data-residency region updated.","compliance_residency_error":"Could not update the residency region.","compliance_residency_select_aria":"Select data-residency region","compliance_clause_ref_aria":"Open the source text for {{clause}}","compliance_fw_official_source":"