s_price":"Input price ($ / 1M tokens, log)","leaderboard_bench_axis_intel":"Intelligence","leaderboard_bench_pareto":"On Pareto frontier","leaderboard_bench_other":"Other models","leaderboard_bench_no_points":"No benchmark data points to plot yet.","leaderboard_bench_tip_price":"Input $/1M","leaderboard_bench_tip_output":"Output $/1M","leaderboard_bench_tip_tps":"Throughput (tok/s)","leaderboard_battle_heading":"Blind Battle","leaderboard_battle_subheading":"Two anonymous models answer the same prompt. Read both, vote the winner, then see who wrote what — your vote feeds the ranking above.","leaderboard_battle_start":"Start a battle","leaderboard_battle_new":"New matchup","leaderboard_battle_mode_ranked":"Ranked matchup","leaderboard_battle_prompt_label":"Prompt","leaderboard_battle_vote_a":"A is better","leaderboard_battle_vote_b":"B is better","leaderboard_battle_tie":"Tie","leaderboard_battle_vote_hint":"Read both answers as they stream, then vote — you can decide before they finish.","leaderboard_battle_vote_ready":"Both answers are in — cast your vote.","leaderboard_battle_reveal":"The reveal","leaderboard_battle_winner":"Winner","leaderboard_battle_community":"Community vote","leaderboard_battle_counts":"Counts toward rankings","leaderboard_battle_sandbox":"Sandbox","leaderboard_battle_sandbox_tag":"Sandbox · doesn't count","leaderboard_battle_sandbox_prompt":"Your prompt","leaderboard_battle_sandbox_placeholder":"Type a prompt to pit two anonymous models against…","leaderboard_battle_already_voted":"You already voted on this matchup — showing the current community split.","leaderboard_battle_coming_soon":"Blind battles coming soon — pick the better answer, then see which model wrote it.","leaderboard_battle_streaming":"Streaming…","leaderboard_battle_error":"Could not start a battle right now.","leaderboard_battle_vote_error":"Could not record your vote right now.","leaderboard_battle_pane_error":"This side could not load.","leaderboard_battle_need_human":"Verifying you are human — please retry in a moment.","leaderboard_col_rating":"Arena Rating","leaderboard_col_method":"Method","leaderboard_rating_ci":"95% confidence interval (± rating points)","leaderboard_method_bt":"blind · BT","leaderboard_method_pref":"preference · provisional","leaderboard_tied":"Statistically tied with the model above","leaderboard_style_control":"Style control","leaderboard_style_control_soon":"Coming soon — needs more battle data","leaderboard_config_pinned":"Pinned config","leaderboard_rating_chart_aria":"Arena rating leaderboard with 95% confidence intervals (Bradley–Terry)","leaderboard_rating_scale":"Elo","leaderboard_provisional_heading":"Provisional — preference win rate (not yet rated)","leaderboard_overall_note_bt":"Blind Battle Mode votes, ranked by a Bradley–Terry (Elo) model. Dots show the rating; bars show the 95% confidence interval. Models within a band are statistically tied.","leaderboard_nav_categories":"Categories","leaderboard_nav_validation":"Validation","leaderboard_nav_trends":"Trends","leaderboard_cat_heading":"Category leaders","leaderboard_cat_note":"The strongest model in each capability — coding, math, reasoning and more — with a per-axis profile against the field median.","leaderboard_cat_profile":"Capability profile","leaderboard_cat_median":"Category median: {{median}}","leaderboard_cat_score_aria":"Score {{score}}","leaderboard_cat_card_empty":"No ranked models yet.","leaderboard_cat_safety":"Safety & robustness","leaderboard_cat_safety_soon":"Safety & robustness scoring is coming soon — jailbreak resistance and refusal calibration.","leaderboard_cat_soon":"Per-capability leaders appear here once category benchmarks are configured.","leaderboard_val_heading":"Validation — agreement with external rankings","leaderboard_val_note":"How closely the community ranking tracks independent external rankings, measured by Spearman’s ρ and Kendall’s τ rank correlation.","leaderboard_val_strong":"strong agreement","leaderboard_val_moderate":"moderate agreement","leaderboard_val_weak":"weak agreement","leaderboard_val_diverge":"diverges","leaderboard_val_corr":"ρ {{rho}} · τ {{tau}} (n={{n}})","leaderboard_val_corr_aria":"Spearman {{rho}}, Kendall {{tau}}, sample size {{n}}","leaderboard_val_axis_community":"Community rank","leaderboard_val_axis_external":"External rank","leaderboard_val_table_caption":"Community rank vs external rank by model","leaderboard_val_chart_aria":"Scatter of community rank vs external rank, with a diagonal agreement line","leaderboard_val_no_points":"Not enough overlapping models to plot yet.","leaderboard_val_hint":"Each point is a model: the closer it sits to the diagonal, the more the community ranking agrees with the external source. ρ is Spearman’s and τ is Kendall’s rank correlation.","leaderboard_val_soon":"Cross-checks against external rankings appear here once a source is configured.","leaderboard_trend_heading":"Trends — ratings over time","leaderboard_trend_note":"Each model’s Arena Rating over the last 90 days, from daily snapshots. A regression badge flags a sustained drop.","leaderboard_trend_up":"Trending up","leaderboard_trend_down":"Trending down","leaderboard_trend_flat":"Flat","leaderboard_trend_spark_summary":"Rating over time: {{start}} to {{end}}, low {{min}}, high {{max}}","leaderboard_trend_regression":"regression {{delta}} · since {{since}}","leaderboard_trend_regression_full":"Rating regression of {{delta}} detected since {{since}}","leaderboard_trend_empty":"Rating trends appear here as daily snapshots accumulate.","leaderboard_trend_hint":"Each line is a model’s Arena Rating over the window; ▲/▼ is the net move. A regression badge flags a sustained drop.","leaderboard_nav_buzz":"Buzz","leaderboard_buzz_heading":"Buzz — popularity & sentiment","leaderboard_buzz_note":"What the community is talking about — mention volume, 14-day momentum and sentiment. Context only, never a ranking signal.","leaderboard_buzz_trending":"Trending","leaderboard_buzz_context_note":"Popularity & sentiment — context only, NOT part of any rank.","leaderboard_buzz_source":"Mentions & sentiment sampled from Reddit and Hacker News. Context only — not a ranking signal.","leaderboard_buzz_soon":"Community buzz appears here once the popularity & sentiment feed is configured.","leaderboard_buzz_sentiment_aria":"Sentiment: {{pos}}% positive, {{neu}}% neutral, {{neg}}% negative","leaderboard_buzz_mentions_aria":"{{count}} mentions in the last 7 days","leaderboard_buzz_positive":"Positive","leaderboard_buzz_neutral":"Neutral","leaderboard_buzz_negative":"Negative","leaderboard_foot_embed":"Embed a rank badge","leaderboard_foot_embed_desc":"Show your model’s live OrcaRouter rank on your site or README.","leaderboard_foot_embed_model":"Model","leaderboard_foot_embed_category":"Category","leaderboard_foot_embed_no_models":"No models yet","leaderboard_foot_embed_copy":"Copy","leaderboard_foot_embed_copy_iframe":"Copy iframe","leaderboard_foot_embed_copy_html":"Copy HTML","leaderboard_foot_embed_copy_md":"Copy Markdown","leaderboard_foot_badge_alt":"{{model}} rank on OrcaRouter","leaderboard_foot_copied":"Copied!","leaderboard_foot_download":"Download data","leaderboard_foot_download_desc":"Grab the full leaderboard as a file — refreshed every snapshot.","leaderboard_foot_download_json":"JSON","leaderboard_foot_download_csv":"CSV","leaderboard_foot_developers":"Developers","leaderboard_foot_developers_desc":"Query the live API, read how rankings are computed, or subscribe to rank changes.","leaderboard_foot_api":"API","leaderboard_foot_methodology":"Methodology","leaderboard_foot_feed":"Rank-change feed (RSS)","leaderboard_foot_methodology_note":"Rankings combine OrcaRouter production traffic with community Battle Mode votes (Bradley–Terry / Wilson). Popularity & sentiment are context only and never affect rank.","leaderboard_foot_attribution":"External benchmark & ranking data via LMArena and Artificial Analysis.","leaderboard_foot_updated":"Snapshot updated {{date}}","blog_author_by":"Article by","blog_author_aria":"About the author","blog_author_linkedin_aria":"{{name}} on LinkedIn","blog_toc_title":"Contents","arena_settings_tab":"Arena","arena_settings_title":"Blind Battle Arena","arena_env_only_note":"Note: OR_LEADERBOARD_EXTERNAL_ENABLED and SEED_DEMO_LEADERBOARD are process environment variables (set at deploy time), not options — they cannot be changed here.","arena_enabled_label":"Enable arena","arena_enabled_help":"Master switch for the public Blind Battle Arena. Off by default; battles also require a curated model pool, prompts and a funded demo workspace/token.","arena_bypass_cache_label":"Bypass cache (call upstream live every battle) — on = always live & billed; off = cache-first (a miss still bills)","arena_bypass_cache_help":"On = always bypass the cache and call the upstream model live for every ranked battle (real traffic, billed; requires a funded and routable demo workspace). Off (default) = cache-first: a cached answer replays free, but a cache miss still falls through to live generation (billed). Off reduces cost via caching but does NOT guarantee zero billing — the demo's true zero-cost safety comes from full cache coverage plus an unfunded/unroutable demo workspace.","arena_demo_workspace_id_label":"Demo workspace ID","arena_demo_workspace_id_help":"Workspace the arena bills live generation to (shared with the playground /compare path).","arena_demo_token_id_label":"Demo token ID","arena_demo_token_id_help":"Funded demo token used to impersonate and bill live arena generation.","arena_daily_budget_usd_label":"Daily budget (USD)","arena_daily_budget_usd_help":"Caps total live-generation spend over a rolling 24h window. 0 or less disables the budget guard (unlimited).","arena_max_output_tokens_label":"Max output tokens","arena_max_output_tokens_help":"Clamps every arena completion so one battle cannot exhaust the demo workspace quota. Must be greater than 0.","arena_auto_latest_models_label":"Auto-include latest models","arena_auto_latest_models_help":"Auto-include the N newest published models in the battle pool. Defaults to 30. Set to 0 to use only the allowlist below.","arena_model_allowlist_label":"Model allowlist","arena_model_allowlist_help":"JSON array of bare model slugs the arena may pair from, e.g. [\"gpt-5\", \"claude-opus-4-8\"].","arena_curated_prompts_label":"Curated prompts","arena_curated_prompts_help":"JSON array of prompt strings served for ranked battles so the leaderboard aggregates over a controlled prompt set.","arena_json_array_invalid":"Model allowlist and curated prompts must each be a JSON array of strings.","arena_number_invalid":"Workspace ID, token ID, budget, max output tokens and auto-latest models must each be a number.","arena_positive_required":"Workspace ID, token ID, and max output tokens must be 1 or greater.","arena_enable_requires_ids":"To enable the arena, set a workspace ID, token ID, and max output tokens of 1 or greater.","arena_refresh_failed":"Refresh failed","arena_save_success":"Saved","arena_save_failed":"Save failed, please retry.","arena_no_changes":"You don’t seem to have changed anything.","arena_partial_save_failed":"Some changes failed to save, please retry.","leaderboard_vol_share_aria":"{{pct}} of tokens this period","leaderboard_vol_spark_aria":"Recent daily token volume — from {{start}} to {{end}} (low {{low}}, high {{high}})","leaderboard_vol_cold_title":"Volume ranking is warming up","leaderboard_vol_cold_body":"We have seen {{models}} models so far this period. The volume ranking unlocks once enough traffic has accumulated to rank models fairly.","leaderboard_vol_total_tokens":"Tokens this period","leaderboard_vol_models_seen":"Models seen","leaderboard_vol_cold_redirect":"In the meantime, the Overall and Reliability boards above are already live.","leaderboard_vol_share":"Share","leaderboard_vol_trend":"Trend","leaderboard_vol_requests_short":"req","leaderboard_vol_show_