rant (Leg A)","campaign_starter_desc":"Credit granted the moment a workspace claims the join code","campaign_starter_amount_hint":"0 = match-only campaign: claiming still enrolls the workspace, grants nothing.","campaign_match_desc":"Match qualifying top-ups while the window is open","campaign_match_enabled_label":"Enable deposit match","campaign_reward_kind_label":"Reward kind","campaign_reward_kind_percent":"Percent of top-up","campaign_reward_kind_fixed":"Fixed amount","campaign_reward_value_fixed_label":"Fixed match amount","campaign_reward_value_percent_label":"Match percent","campaign_reward_value_percent_hint":"Whole percents of the base top-up: 100 = +100%. Range 1-1000.","campaign_reward_cap_label":"Per-top-up cap","campaign_reward_cap_hint":"Cap on the match of one top-up. 0 = uncapped.","campaign_per_ws_cap_label":"Per-participant cap","campaign_per_ws_cap_hint":"Total match one workspace can earn. Required (> 0) while matching is on.","campaign_min_topup_label":"Minimum top-up (USD)","campaign_min_topup_hint":"Top-ups below this face value do not match.","campaign_match_auto_topup_label":"Match auto top-ups","campaign_match_auto_topup_hint":"Off = automatic recharges are excluded from matching.","campaign_stacks_marketing_label":"Stack with marketing bonus","campaign_stacks_marketing_hint":"Off = the campaign match replaces the marketing bonus on matched top-ups.","campaign_scope_title":"Scope & eligibility","campaign_scope_desc":"Which models the credit covers and who can join","campaign_model_scope_placeholder":"Pick models — or type a pattern like gpt-4o* — leave empty for all models","campaign_model_scope_hint":"Campaign credit only spends on these models (starter AND match). Leave empty to cover all models.","campaign_country_scope_label":"Country targeting","campaign_country_scope_placeholder":"Any country (leave empty)","campaign_country_scope_hint":"Restrict who can claim the join code by country. Requires server-side geolocation.","campaign_requ