er","campaign_closed_title":"This campaign is closed","campaign_closed_sub":"{{name}} is no longer accepting new participants. Follow {{partner}} and OrcaRouter for the next drop.","campaign_countdown_dh":"{{days}}d {{hours}}h","campaign_countdown_hm":"{{hours}}h {{minutes}}m","campaign_countdown_m":"{{minutes}}m","campaign_countdown_ms":"{{minutes}}m {{seconds}}s","campaign_countdown_s":"{{seconds}}s","campaign_enroll_closed":"Enrollment closed","campaign_enroll_closes_in":"Enrollment closes in {{time}}","campaign_match_fixed_line":"+{{amount}} match on every qualifying top-up","campaign_match_percent_line":"+{{value}}% match on every qualifying top-up","campaign_match_cap_line":"up to {{cap}} per top-up","campaign_match_min_line":"on top-ups of ${{min}}+","campaign_starter_line":"{{amount}} starter credit when you join","campaign_credit_expiry_line":"All campaign credit expires {{date}}","campaign_join_cta":"Claim & join","campaign_match_bonus_line":"+{{amount}} campaign credit on this top-up","campaign_match_wallet_row":"To wallet now","campaign_match_credit_row":"Campaign credit (expires {{date}})","campaign_match_credit_row_bare":"Campaign credit","campaign_match_min_hint":"Top up ${{min}} or more to get the {{partner}} match","campaign_match_remaining_line":"{{amount}} match allowance remaining","campaign_match_window_ends":"Match window ends in {{time}}","campaign_match_rails_line":"Match applies to payments via {{rails}}","campaign_match_scope_line":"Campaign credit applies to {{models}} only","campaign_match_starts":"Match starts {{date}}","campaign_join_headline":"Join {{name}}","campaign_joined_title":"You're in — {{name}}","campaign_enroll_deadline_static":"Enrollment closes {{date}}","campaign_closed_sub_no_partner":"{{name}} is no longer accepting new participants.","campaign_ws_enrolled_tag":"already enrolled","campaign_ws_enrolled_note":"This workspace has already joined this campaign — choose another workspace to claim.","admin_section_campaigns":"Campaigns","campaigns_sidebar":"Campaigns","requests_filter_app":"App","requests_filter_app_unknown":"Unknown","behavior_rows_expand_all":"Expand all","behavior_rows_collapse_all":"Collapse all","behavior_row_cache_title":"Cache-aware stickiness","behavior_row_cache_on_recommended":"On (recommended)","behavior_row_cache_off":"Off","behavior_row_escalation_title":"Frontier escalation","behavior_row_fallback_title":"Fallback model","behavior_row_tuning_title":"Adaptive tuning","behavior_row_tuning_defaults":"defaults","behavior_row_tuning_custom":"customized","escalation_summary_off":"Off","escalation_summary_manual":"Manual (client-requested)","escalation_summary_auto_shadow":"Auto · shadow — collecting","escalation_summary_auto_live_pct":"Auto · live {{pct}}% of sessions","escalation_summary_auto_live_all":"Auto · live for all sessions","escalation_card_intro":"Rescue a stuck conversation by moving it to a stronger pool. Only applies to requests routed through this router.","escalation_mode_label":"Mode","escalation_mode_off_label":"Off","escalation_mode_off_desc":"never switch mid-session","escalation_mode_manual_label":"Manual","escalation_mode_manual_desc":"only when the client asks","escalation_mode_auto_label":"Auto","escalation_mode_auto_desc":"difficulty + failure signals","escalation_off_hint":"Stuck conversations stay on their pinned model. Clients can still start a new session to re-route.","escalation_pool_label":"Escalate to","escalation_pool_hint":"Model names or @pool:\u003cname> refs, comma-separated. Leave empty to fall back to this router's Hard models (strong pool).","escalation_pool_placeholder":"Empty = strong pool, e.g. anthropic/claude-opus-4-8, openai/gpt-5.2","escalation_contract_title":"Clients escalate with:","escalation_contract_session_desc":"whole session","escalation_contract_once_desc":"this request only","escalation_safety_title":"Safety limits","escalation_max_per_session_label":"Max escalations per session","escalation_max_per_session_hint":"0 = server default (1).","escalation_share_cap_label":"Escalated-spend share cap","escalation_share_cap_hint":"Share of trailing-24h router spend, manual asks included. 0 = no cap.","escalation_triggers_title":"Auto triggers","escalation_strikes_label":"Objective strikes to escalate","escalation_strikes_signals_hint":"Malformed diffs · failed tests after an edit · repeated tool errors.","escalation_fuzzy_label":"Fuzzy signals (self-doubt, low logprob)","escalation_corroboration_label":"Require corroboration (recommended — always enforced)","escalation_rollout_title":"Rollout","escalation_rollout_shadow_label":"Shadow — log would-escalate decisions, never switch","escalation_rollout_live_pct_prefix":"Live for","escalation_rollout_live_pct_suffix":"% of sessions","escalation_rollout_live_all_label":"Live for all sessions","escalation_empty_pool_banner":"Escalation needs a target pool. Add models to “Escalate to”, or fill the Hard models list (Adaptive-gated) — saving will fail until one is set.","escalation_dsl_hint":"Frontier escalation for DSL routers is written in rules via session_tier.* / difficulty / agent_state.* — see the DSL docs.","escalation_summary_requires_redis":"Unavailable — requires Redis","escalation_redis_banner":"Frontier escalation requires Redis (session tier state and spend caps live there). Configure REDIS_CONN_STRING to enable.","tryit_prompt_label":"Prompt","tryit_prompt_placeholder":"Refactor this async queue to avoid the race condition in flush() …","tryit_session_label":"Session id (optional)","tryit_run_btn":"Run","sim_difficulty_label":"Difficulty","sim_difficulty_line":"difficulty {{score}} → {{band}} band","sim_band_easy":"easy","sim_band_mid":"mid","sim_band_hard":"hard","sim_delta_note":"delta vs last turn {{delta}}","sim_thresholds_note":"bands: easy \u003c {{t1}} · hard > {{t2}}","sim_session_label":"Session","sim_pins_none":"none given — new conversation, no pin","sim_pins_empty":"no pins yet for this session","sim_pin_ba