uting_title":"Routing","log_esc_decided_by":"decided by","log_esc_session":"session","log_esc_turn":"turn {{n}}","log_esc_reason":"reason","log_esc_tier_transition":"tier {{from}} → {{to}}","log_esc_tier_steady":"tier {{tier}}","log_esc_denied_line":"denied — {{reason}} (request stayed on the base tier)","log_esc_shadow_note":"shadow — logged only, request stayed on its normal route","log_esc_once_note":"single-turn boost — no pins written, counted in the share cap only","log_esc_badge_escalated":"escalated","log_esc_badge_strong":"strong","log_esc_badge_would":"would escalate","log_esc_badge_denied":"escalate denied","log_esc_badge_once":"1× boost","log_esc_badge_returned":"returned","strategy_recommended_tag":"Recommended","strategy_card_balanced_desc":"Cheap when possible, never below the quality bar.","strategy_card_cheapest_desc":"Always the lowest price. Quality can drop on hard tasks.","strategy_card_cheapest_pairing":"Tip: pair with Frontier escalation below.","strategy_card_quality_label":"Quality first","strategy_card_quality_desc":"Always the strongest model. Costs the most.","strategy_card_adaptive_label":"Adaptive — learns your traffic","strategy_card_adaptive_desc":"Tries candidates, learns which model wins for your prompts.","strategy_card_gated_label":"Adaptive-gated — learns within difficulty bands","strategy_card_gated_desc":"Easy prompts → weak pool, hard → strong pool; it learns the rest.","strategy_card_dsl_desc":"Your own routing rules (YAML + CEL), with dry-run and tests.","strategy_compare_link":"Compare strategies","strategy_compare_title":"Compare strategies","strategy_compare_col_strategy":"Strategy","strategy_compare_col_cost":"Cost","strategy_compare_col_quality":"Quality","strategy_compare_col_tuning":"Tuning","strategy_compare_col_pick":"Pick when…","strategy_compare_tuning_none":"none","strategy_compare_tuning_learns":"none — learns","strategy_compare_tuning_pools":"2 pools","strategy_compare_tuning_rules":"rules","strategy_compare_you_decide":"you decide","strategy_compare_rating_low":"Low","strategy_compare_rating_medium":"Medium","strategy_compare_rating_high":"High","strategy_compare_rating_medium_to_low":"Medium, decreasing","strategy_compare_rating_low_to_high":"Low to high","strategy_compare_balanced_pick":"unsure — start here","strategy_compare_cheapest_pick":"bulk / draft work","strategy_compare_quality_pick":"correctness > cost","strategy_compare_adaptive_pick":"steady traffic mix (≥200 reqs/wk)","strategy_compare_gated_pick":"mixed easy + hard traffic","strategy_compare_dsl_pick":"special workflows","pool_match_count":"matches {{n}}","pool_match_zero_warn":"No model in your group matches — this gate is disabled until it matches something.","pool_wildcard_warn":"Wildcards don't match in pool fields — insert exact model names.","allowed_expand_count":"{{n}} models","allowed_expand_overflow":"+{{n}} more","allowed_unknown_token_warn":"\"{{token}}\" not in your group — ignored","allowed_unresolved_ref_warn":"{{ref}} doesn't match any saved list — ignored","fallback_summary_none":"none — requests error if no candidate is up","fallback_summary_ok_suffix":"used only when nothing in Allowed models is available","fallback_summary_unavailable_suffix":"not available in your group","fallback_status_ok":"Available in your group","cr_nav":"Orca Code Review","apps_nav":"Apps","apps_page_subtitle":"Products built on your OrcaRouter gateway — set up once, then pay only the token cost of what runs.","apps_badge_live":"Live","apps_status_setup":"Not set up","apps_open":"Open","apps_setup":"Set up","apps_cr_desc":"Frontier-quality pull-request review on your repos, with guardrails and a cost-routed model recipe.","apps_ghost_title":"More apps, one home","apps_ghost_desc":"Every new product built on the gateway lands here as a card — the sidebar never grows.","apps_orcadub_title":"OrcaDub","apps_orcadub_desc":"Translate and dub your videos into any language with AI voices.","apps_orcadub_api":"API docs","cr_page_subtitle":"Frontier-quality pull request review on your repos — you pay token cost only.","cr_intro_title":"Set up code review","cr_intro_desc":"One click provisions the three resources this workspace needs to review pull requests:","cr_res_router":"Router","cr_res_router_desc":"Cheap-to-strong cascade recipe — editable after setup.","cr_res_guardrail":"Guardrail","cr_res_guardrail_desc":"Secrets, PII, prompt injection and code security, in flag mode.","cr_res_token":"API key","cr_res_token_desc":"A dedicated key for the GitHub Action.","cr_create_btn":"Create code review setup","cr_status_created":"created","cr_status_exists":"already existed","cr_res_present":"Present","cr_res_missing":"Missing","cr_configured_banner":"Code review is configured for this workspace.","cr_setup_incomplete":"Setup isn't complete — a resource below still needs your attention.","cr_resources_title":"Resources","cr_step_secret_title":"Add the repository secret","cr_step_secret_desc":"In GitHub, open Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions and create a repository secret named {{name}}.","cr_token_once":"Copy this key now — it will not be shown again.","cr_token_provisioned":"Key already provisioned — rotate it from the Keys page if you need a new value.","cr_keys_page_link":"Open Keys page","cr_step_workflow_title":"Commit the workflow file","cr_step_workflow_desc":"Add this file to your repository — every pull request is reviewed automatically from then on.","cr_reviewed_prs":"Reviewed PRs: {{n}}","cr_runs":"Review runs: {{n}}","cr_edit_recipe":"Edit models in the recipe","cr_rerun_setup":"Re-run setup (repairs)","cr_setup_done":"Code review setup is ready","cr_copy":"Copy","cr_copy_api_key":"Copy API key","cr_copy_workflow":"Copy workflow file","cr_copied":"Copied","cr_copy_failed":"Copy failed — please select and copy manually","cr_tab_setup":"Setup","cr_tab_analytics":"Analytics","cr_tab_settings":"Settings","cr_an_window_7d":"7 days","cr_an_window_30d":"30 days","cr_an_window_90d":"90 days","cr_an_tile_issues":"Issues found","cr_an_tile_prs":"PRs reviewed","cr_an_tile_runs":"Review runs","cr_an_tile_gate_rate":"Changes-requested rate","cr_an_tile_gate_rate_hint":"Share of runs where findings met the blocking severity, so the review requested changes","cr_an_tile_cheap_share":"Cheap-tier runs","cr_an_tile_cheap_share_hint":"Share of runs tagged cheap tier. The tag records the mode the run claimed, not the model that served it — your router recipe chooses that.","cr_an_tile_spend":"Token spend","cr_an_tile_spend_hint":"Total relay token cost of code-review runs in this window (the code-review key's spend).","cr_an_tile_cost_per_pr":"Cost / PR","cr_an_tile_cost_per_pr_hint":"Token spend divided by the number of pull requests reviewed in this window.","cr_an_chart_title":"Issues by severity per day","cr_an_chart_empty":"No review runs in this window yet.","cr_an_truncated_notice":"Showing the most recent runs only — this window has more review activity than the dashboard can display, so earlier days may be undercounted.","cr_an_prs_chart_title":"PRs reviewed per day","cr_an_repo_title":"By repository","cr_an_repo_col_repo":"Repository","cr_an_repo_col_gate_fails":"Changes requested","cr_an_repo_empty":"No reviews recorded yet — finish the setup and open a pull request to see analytics.","cr_an_repo_empty_cta":"Open Setup","cr_set_defaults_title":"Workspace defaults","cr_set_auto_review":"Auto review","cr_set_trigger":"Review trigger","cr_set_trigger_every_push":"Every push","cr_set_trigger_ready":"Ready for review","cr_set_trigger_on_demand":"On demand","cr_set_exhaustive":"Exhaustive mode","cr_set_exhaustive_warn":"Runs the strong model on every pass — significantly higher token cost.","cr_set_quiet":"Quiet mode","cr_set_quiet_hint":"Comment only when issues are found.","cr_set_fix_first":"Fix first","cr_set_fix_first_hint":"Severities the agent tries to fix before flagging; empty = never.","cr_set_block_on":"Block merge on","cr_set_block_on_hint":"Severities that fail the merge gate; empty = never block.","cr_set_rubric":"Custom rubric","cr_set_rubric_hint":"Empty = built-in rubric. Custom text must keep the [P0]/[P1]/[P2] tag mandate.","cr_set_save":"Save defaults","cr_set_saved":"Review settings saved","cr_set_repos_title":"Per-repository overrides","cr_set_repos_desc":"Each field either inherits the workspace default or overrides it for that repository.","cr_set_add_repo":"Add repo override","cr_set_repo_invalid":"Repository must be owner/name (letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores; max 191 characters).","cr_set_repo_exists":"An override for this repository already exists.","cr_set_inherit":"Inherit","cr_set_on":"On","cr_set_off":"Off","cr_set_none":"None","cr_set_custom":"Custom","cr_set_override":"Override","cr_set_edit":"Edit","cr_set_delete":"Delete","cr_set_edit_repo":"Edit {{repo}}","cr_set_delete_repo":"Delete {{repo}}","cr_set_delete_confirm_title":"Remove this override?","cr_set_delete_confirm_desc":"The repository will inherit the workspace defaults.","cr_set_editor_title":"Repository overrides","cr_set_save_repo":"Save overrides","cr_set_repo_saved":"Repository override saved","cr_set_repo_deleted":"Repository override removed","cr_set_repos_empty":"No per-repository overrides yet.","cr_set_cancel":"Cancel","cr_app_title":"GitHub App","cr_app_desc":"Review pull requests automatically with the OrcaRouter GitHub App — no CI workflow to maintain.","cr_app_connect":"Connect GitHub App","cr_app_connected_to":"Connected to {{account}}","cr_app_scope_all":"All repositories","cr_app_scope_selected":"Selected repositories","cr_app_suspended":"Suspended on GitHub — reviews are paused.","cr_app_reconfigure":"Reconfigure","cr_app_manage":"Manage on GitHub","cr_app_install_success":"GitHub App connected.","cr_app_install_error":"Could not connect the GitHub App. Please try again.","cr_app_cta_title":"Add Orca Code Review to GitHub","cr_app_cta_sub":"One click connects your repositories. No secrets, no workflow files — Orca reviews every new pull request automatically.","cr_app_cta_btn":"Add to GitHub","cr_adv_action_title":"Self-managed GitHub Action (no App required)","cr_adv_action_sub":"Run reviews from your own CI instead of the hosted App — for orgs where the App isn't available, or to repair the router, guardrail and token that setup provisions.","cr_done_title":"You're all set","cr_done_next_desc":"Every new pull request gets an automated review; blocking findings are posted inline. Tune the policy anytime in Settings.","cr_done_test_pr":"Open a test PR","crl_seo_title":"AI Code Review at Cost Price — OrcaRouter","crl_seo_desc":"A GitHub Action that reviews every pull request with frontier models at provider token prices. Cheap screening on every push, a strong model on clean passes, guardrails built in.","crl_hero_eyebrow":"Orca Code Review","crl_hero_title":"Frontier-quality code review at cost price.","crl_hero_sub":"Every push is screened by a cheap frontier model; clean passes are promoted to a strong one. You pay provider token prices — no seats, no markup.","crl_cta_install":"Install — free","crl_cta_docs":"Read the docs","crl_cta_github":"Add to GitHub — free","crl_hero_trust_free":"Free to start","crl_hero_trust_nocard":"No credit card","crl_hero_trust_everypr":"Reviews every pull request","crl_shot_caption":"Suggested change","crl_shot_aria":"Example Orca review","crl_why_title":"Reviews that ship, at a price that doesn't sting","crl_why_1_t":"One click, no plumbing","crl_why_1_d":"Install the GitHub App and Orca reviews every new pull request — no repository secret, no workflow file, no CI to babysit.","crl_why_2_t":"A fraction of the cost","crl_why_2_d":"Smart cheap/strong routing means you pay for tokens at zero markup — typically a fraction of flat-rate rivals. Free to start.","crl_why_3_t":"Safe by default","crl_why_3_d":"Secrets, PII, and prompt-injection are masked before a single token leaves your gateway. Your code never trains anyone's model.","crl_calc_title":"Estimate your monthly cost","crl_calc_sub":"Token-cost review compared with per-seat bots. Figures are estimates — actual cost scales with diff size.","crl_calc_devs":"Developers","crl_calc_prs":"PRs per month","crl_calc_pushes":"Pushes per PR","crl_calc_estimate_badge":"estimate","crl_calc_note":"Assumes 25k input + 4k output tokens per pass at {{model}} list prices. The routing recipe stays yours to edit.","crl_calc_month":"per month","crl_how_title":"How it works","crl_how_1_t":"Every push, cheap-screened","crl_how_1_d":"Each push gets an instant pass from a low-cost frontier model that catches the obvious problems in seconds.","crl_how_2_t":"Clean passes promote to strong","crl_how_2_d":"When the cheap screen finds nothing serious, the final review escalates to a strong model for a deep pass.","crl_how_3_t":"P0–P1 findings gate the merge","crl_how_3_d":"Critical findings fail the GitHub check and block the merge until they are fixed or explicitly waived.","crl_guard_title":"Guardrails on by default","crl_guard_1_t":"Secrets","crl_guard_1_d":"Leaked keys and credentials are flagged in every diff.","crl_guard_2_t":"PII","crl_guard_2_d":"Personal data is detected before it reaches any model.","crl_guard_3_t":"Prompt injection","crl_guard_3_d":"Instructions hidden in diffs or comments are caught and flagged.","crl_guard_4_t":"Code security","crl_guard_4_d":"Insecure patterns are reported with severity labels.","crl_quickstart_title":"Quickstart","crl_quickstart_desc":"One repository secret and one workflow file:","crl_quickstart_selfhost_note":"Self-hosting a custom gateway? Copy the ready-made workflow from your console — it targets your own gateway, not the public API.","crl_pricing_title":"Pricing","crl_price_free_t":"Free","crl_price_free_d":"Tokens at cost. No seats, no minimums.","crl_price_team_t":"Team","crl_price_team_d":"Shared dashboard, org-wide policies and SSO.","crl_price_ent_t":"Enterprise","crl_price_ent_d":"Self-host the gateway in your own VPC.","crl_faq_title":"Frequently asked questions","crl_faq_1_q":"Can I self-host it?","crl_faq_1_a":"Yes. Enterprise runs the whole gateway — router, guardrails and review action — inside your own VPC, so code never leaves your network.","crl_faq_2_q":"Which models review my code?","crl_faq_2_a":"The default recipe reviews every pass with GPT-5.5. It is a normal OrcaRouter recipe — swap in any of 200+ models, or split the passes into a cheap screen and a strong final review.","crl_faq_3_q":"What reaches the model?","crl_faq_3_a":"Only the pull request diff plus the context the reviewer requests. Nothing is stored for training, and guardrails flag secrets and personal data first.","crl_faq_4_q":"What about prompt injection?","crl_faq_4_a":"A dedicated guardrail scans diffs and comments for hidden instructions before they reach the reviewer, and flags anything suspicious on the PR.","crl_faq_5_q":"Why is it cheaper — what's the catch?","crl_faq_5_a":"No catch: we run the gateway, so you pay provider token prices instead of per-seat fees. Paid tiers add the dashboard, policies and SSO.","crl_pricing_page_link":"Shipping with AI? Get frontier-quality code review at token cost →","adoption_avg_difficulty":"Avg task difficulty","adoption_avg_difficulty_prior":"vs {{v}} the prior 4 weeks","adoption_funnel_title":"Activation funnel (trailing 12 weeks)","adoption_kpi_activation":"New-seat activation \u003c14d","adoption_kpi_activation_note":"seats added in the last 12 weeks","adoption_kpi_habitual":"Habitual (3+ days/wk)","adoption_kpi_mau":"Monthly active","adoption_kpi_wau":"Weekly active","adoption_ladder_since":"depth signals since {{since}}","adoption_ladder_title":"Sophistication ladder","adoption_load_failed":"Could not load adoption analytics.","adoption_moved_up":"{{n}} members moved up a stage this month","adoption_platform_note":"Measures usage of this platform only — AI use outside it is not visible.","adoption_task_mix_empty":"No 